ng flight dynamics.\n\nProject structure: src/main/ with standard Betaflight layout — flight/, fc/, drivers/, sensors/, io/, cli/, msp/, rx/, osd/, telemetry/, pg/, config/. Build via Makefile targeting STM32F3/F4/F7 MCUs.", :tags=>"code,structure,overview", :links=>"README.md,Makefile,src/main/flight/", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 01:17:15", :score=>4}], :aegis_orientation=>{:tags=>["task", "ferocity", "ondas", "porting"], :summary=>"User wants to port \"ferocity\" wave-shaping from RP2040 project (o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul) into OrniFlight, combining with ONDAS stabilization. Need to study the new algorithm first.", :temperature=>0.0, :working_dir=>nil, :thinking=>nil}, :execution_time=>0.006}, :args=>{:summary=>"User wants to port \"ferocity\" wave-shaping from RP2040 project (o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul) into OrniFlight, combining with ONDAS stabilization. Need to study the new algorithm first.", :tags=>["task", "ferocity", "ondas", "porting"], :temperature=>0.0}, :execution_time=>0.008}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_vAK3Ny2ShVF3w1vnFw6d7732", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: /Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/CHANGELOG.md\n/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul.ino\n/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/README.md\n/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/.gitignore\n/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/examples/PPM_Exemplo/PPM_Exemplo.ino\n/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/examples/CRSF_Exemplo/CRSF_Exemplo.ino\n/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/DOCUMENTATION.md\n/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KO