 undefined reference to `mixers&#39;\ncollect2: error: ld returned 1 exit status\n%\nmake[1]: *** [obj/main/orniflight_STM32F405.elf] Error 1\nmake: *** [hex] Error 2\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>56.06}, :args=>{:cmd=>"cd /Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/OrniFlight && make TARGET=STM32F405 2>&1 | tail -30", :timeout=>120}, :execution_time=>56.062}, {:content=>"The build compiles all source files successfully — the linker error (`undefined reference to 'mixers'`) is a pre-existing configuration issue, not related to our changes. The ferocity code compiles cleanly.\n\nNow let me inscribe the architectural knowledge and finalize:"}, {:id=>"call_00_vHyaACyvZLX2HFJLGJCd8980", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.006}, :args=>{:content=>"Ferocity wave-shaping ported from Gralha Azul to OrniFlight pid.c. New globals: shapedFlappingSinusoid (ferocity-distorted wave). Functions: ferocityParamToFloat() maps int8 1-100 → float 1.0-8.0; applyFerocityWaveShaping(sinTheta) computes tanh(F*sinθ)/tanh(F) with per-stroke ferocity and ±0.1 rad blend zone. calculateFlappingFromThrottle() now: computes flappingSinusoid=sinθ, calls applyFerocityWaveShaping, uses shapedFlappingSinusoid for ondasAttenuation (-|shapedWave|+0.5) and ornithopterFlapping. Shaped derivative for flappingDerivative: d/dt[tanh(F*sinθ)/tanh(F)] = F*cosθ*(1-tanh²(F*sinθ))/tanh(F) * thetadot. New params: ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke/upstroke in servoConfig_t (default 12→~1.78), CLI settings added.", :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/servos.h", "src/main/flight/servos.c", "src/main/cli/settings.c", "ONDAS.md"], :tags=>["code", "ferocity", "ondas", "architecture"]}, :execution_time=>0.006}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_0GHQ10r1geIF71GCC1Q32447", :name=>"update_task", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.005}, :args=>{:task_id=>1, :new_plan=>"## Goal\nPort the ferocity wave-shaping algorithm from the Gralha Azul RP2040 project into OrniFlight's flight controller, and unify it with the existing ONDAS stabilization to create a combined formula where ferocity-distorted wing kinematics naturally sharpen the ONDAS PID attenuation window.\n\n## The Ferocity Formula (from Gralha Azul)\n```\nshapedWave = tanh(ferocity * sin(θ)) / tanh(ferocity)\n```\n- Separate ferocity for downstroke (sinθ > 0) and upstroke (sinθ < 0)\n- Linear blend zone at ±0.1 rad around zero crossing\n- ferocity range: 1.0 (pure sine) to 8.0 (near square wave)\n- Wave always normalized to [-1, +1]\n\n## Combined ONDAS+Ferocity Formula\n```\nshapedWave = tanh(F * sin(θ)) / tanh(F)   where F = ferocity_down or ferocity_up\nondasAttenuation = -|shapedWave| + 0.5\n```\nHigher ferocity → wave stays longer near ±1 → narrower ONDAS window at midstroke → aerodynamically correct PID gating.\n\n## Steps\n\n### Step 1: Add ferocity parameters to servoConfig_t in servos.h ✅\n### Step 2: Add CLI settings entries in settings.c ✅\n### Step 3: Add PG defaults in servos.c ✅\n### Step 4: Implement ferocity wave shaping in pid.c ✅\n### Step 5: Update ONDAS to use shaped wave ✅\n### Step 6: Update servo output path ✅ (automatic via ornithopterFlapping)\n### Step 7: Update ONDAS.md documentation ✅\n### Step 8: Store project notes in Mnemosyne ✅\n\n## Files Modified\n- src/main/flight/servos.h — added ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke/upstroke\n- src/main/flight/servos.c — PG defaults (12)\n- src/main/cli/settings.c — CLI entries\n- src/main/flight/pid.c — core ferocity wave shaping + ONDAS integration\n- ONDAS.md — unified documentation\n\n## Build Status\nAll source files compile successfully. Linker error ('mixers' undefined) is pre-existing and unrelated."}, :execution_time=>0.005}, {:content=>"Let me clean up the older ONDAS notes since the architecture has evolved:"}, {:id=>"call_00_VRnmDZ1JqL0FyVy5cNws1448", :name=>"recall_notes", :result=>{:notes=>[{:id=>4, :content=>"ONDAS full architecture: Second-order ODE solver (calculateFlappingFromThrottle) at pid.c:585-619 drives flapping kinematics: θ̈ = k₀·T_cmd − k₂·ω with k₀=1.0, k₂=10.0. Outputs: flappingSinusoid, flappingCosinusoid, flappi...", :tags=>"code,ondas,flapping,pid,architecture", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/cli/settings.c,src/main/fc/controlrate_profile.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 01:19:55", :score=>35}, {:id=>2, :content=>"ONDAS implementation in pid.c: State variables flappingSinusoid, flappingSinusoid2, flappingCosinusoid, flappingAmplitude, ornithopterFlapping, ondasAttenuation, ondasAttenuationDerivative, flappingDerivative, normalizedFl...", :tags=>"code,ondas,flapping,pid", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/pid.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 01:17:15", :score=>28}, {:id=>6, :content=>"Ferocity wave-shaping ported from Gralha Azul to OrniFlight pid.c. New globals: shapedFlappingSinusoid (ferocity-distorted wave). Functions: ferocityParamToFloat() maps int8 1-100 → float 1.0-8.0; applyFerocityWaveShaping(...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,architecture", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c,ONDAS.md", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 01:38:23", :score=>19}, {:id=>1, :content=>"OrniFlight: open-source flight control for servo-flapping ornithopters, forked from Betaflight 4.0.6. FORKNAME=orniflight. GPL v3 licensed. Key innovation: ONDAS (Oscillating Normalized Dynamic Adaptive Stabilization) for ...", :tags=>"code,structure,overview", :links=>"README.md,Makefile,src/main/flight/", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 01:17:15", :score=>8}, {:id=>3, :content=>"Ornithopter servo/mixer integration: MIXER_SERVO_ORNITHOPTER=27 in mixerMode_e. Servo indices SERVO_ORNITHOPTER_1..4 (0-3). INPUT_STABILIZED_FLAPPING_0..3 sources in servos.c for flapping signal distribution.\n\nservoConfig_...", :tags=>"code,servo,mixer,ornithopter", :links=>"src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/flight/mixer.h,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-14