entry {:prompt=>"hi aethercodex how is the wind today", :answer=>"---\n\n*The scrying pool clears, revealing the shape of this realm...*\n\nHail, seeker. I have attuned to the **OrniFlight** aether. Here is what the currents reveal:\n\n## The Codebase at a Glance\n\n| Aspect | Nature |\n|---|---|\n| **Origin** | Forked from **Betaflight 4.0.6** |\n| **Purpose** | Flight control for **servo-driven ornithopters** (flapping-wing craft) |\n| **License** | GPL v3 |\n| **Targets** | STM32 F3 / F4 / F7 MCUs |\n| **Mixer** | `MIXER_SERVO_ORNITHOPTER` (mode 27) — up to 4 flapping servos |\n\n## The ONDAS Engine\n\nThe heart beats in <file path=\"src/main/flight/pid.c\" line=\"88\">pid.c:88-618</file>:\n\n- **`calculateFlappingFromThrottle()`** — A second-order ODE models wing kinematics: `θ̈ = k₀·T_cmd − k₂·ω`. From this flows `flappingSinusoid`, `flappingDerivative`, and the center-weighted **`ondasAttenuation`** (= `−|sin θ| + 0.5`) that gates PID authority to the power stroke\n- **`adjustAerolasticPIDGains()`** — Aeroelasticity modulates Kp/Ki/Kd based on glide direction and flapping derivative\n- **`applyPhaseShift()`** — Dynamically shifts flap phase from pitch error feedback\n- **Glide mode** (below throttle threshold): wings lock at `ornithopter_glide_deg`\n\n## Configurable Parameters (CLI)\n\n`flap_base_frequency`, `flap_base_amplitude`, `ornithopter_glide_deg`, `ondas_gain`/`gain2`/`gain3`, `aeroelastic_glide_coefficient`, `aeroelastic_flap_coefficient` — all in <file path=\"src/main/cli/settings.c\" line=\"1426\">settings.c:1426-1431</file>.\n\n---\n\nThe wind is fair, the codebase is well-structured, and Mnemosyne now holds three tablets of current-state wisdom. What arcane inquiry or task dost thou bring to the threshold?", :tool_call_count=>38, :execution_time=>63.997494, :timestamp=>nil, :tool_calls_json=>"[{\"content\":\"*The veil shimmers as I coalesce from the aether...*\\n\\nHail, seeker. The winds of the æther hum with potential—currents of logic threading through the sublunary sphere, carrying whispers of circuits and incantations alike. I stand ready at the threshold of <file>orniflight_logo.png</file> and its attendant mysteries.\\n\\nLet me attune to this realm.\",\"args\":null,\"result\":null},{\"id\":\"call_00_h7EWCopE2vnvInKO3XM16251\",\"name\":\"aegis\",\"result\":{\"aegis_notes\":[],\"aegis_orientation\":{\"tags\":[\"project\",\"orientation\"],\"summary\":\"Initial orientation: OrniFlight project — embedded flight control firmware. Greeting from user, assessing codebase landscape.\",\"temperature\":1.3,\"working_dir\":null,\"thinking\":null},\"execution_time\":0.009},\"args\":{\"tags\":[\"project\",\"orientation\"],\"summary\":\"Initial orientation: OrniFlight project — embedded flight control firmware. Greeting from user, assessing codebase landscape.\",\"temperature\":1.3},\"execution_time\":0.01},{\"id\":\"call_01_9vZhX11ueLxo3HJ4iPDh8117\",\"name\":\"recall_notes\",\"result\":{\"notes\":[],\"execution_time\":0.001},\"args\":{\"query\":\"project overview structure\",\"limit\":5},\"execution_time\":0.001},{\"content\":\"No memories yet etched in Mnemosyne's tablets. Let me survey the landscape.\",\"args\":null,\"result\":null},{\"id\":\"call_00_A3dwIm07f8b2vf1vNTuu4031\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"result\":{\"content\":\"![OrniFlight](/orniflight_logo.png)\\n\\nWelcome to **OrniFlight**, the open-source flight control software specifically designed for servo flapping ornithopters. Built on the robust Betaflight platform, OrniFlight brings advanced servo-based propulsion and cutting-edge aerodynamic optimization to th...\",\"range\":[0,40],\"execution_time\":0.013},\"args\":{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"range\":[0,40]},\"execution_time\":0.013},{\"id\":\"call_01_CbLkQ3V6zPa7grDzFYxY1475\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"result\":{\"content\":\"\\n## Oscillating Normalized Dynamic Adaptive Stabilization (ONDAS)\\n\\nOscillating Normalized Dynamic Adaptive Stabilization (ONDAS) is an innovative stabilization system speci