entry {:prompt=>"how can we simulate this?", :answer=>"---\n\n## Simulation Built: `sim_ferocity.rb`\n\nThree modes, matching the firmware's actual ODE and gating equations:\n\n### 1. Static Wave Shape\n```bash\nruby sim_ferocity.rb wave [ferocity_down] [ferocity_up]\n```\nShows one full flap cycle — `theta`, `sin_theta`, `shaped_wave`, `ondas_attenuation`.  \nAt **F=12** (near-sine): ONDAS window ≈ 60° wide.  \nAt **F=100** (near-square): sin(30°)=0.5 already shaped to **0.999** — the wave snaps early.\n\n### 2. Full Flight Simulation\n```bash\nruby sim_ferocity.rb flight [duration_s] [F_down] [F_up] [gust_time] [gust_magnitude]\n```\nModels the complete loop: Wing ODE → ferocity shaping → ONDAS gating → PID → airframe pitch. You can inject a gust and watch recovery.\n\nFrom the 3-second run I just did: the PID recovers from a 10°/s gust within ~0.5s, with the ONDAS window rhythmically gating the correction authority.\n\n### 3. Parameter Sweep\n```bash\nruby sim_ferocity.rb sweep\n```\nScans 1–100 ferocity in steps of 10, reporting max pitch amplitude and RMS pitch rate.\n\n**Key result from the sweep:** balanced ferocity (`F_down ≈ F_up ≈ 5–6`) minimizes pitch amplitude. Pure sine (F=1) is also stable but produces symmetric thrust with no aerodynamic pitch bias — you lose the asymmetric control you wanted.\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to tune the airframe model parameters to better match your actual ornithopter, or explore specific ferocity combinations?", :tool_call_count=>23, :execution_time=>201.729822, :timestamp=>nil, :tool_calls_json=>"[{\"content\":\"A standalone simulation that models the wing ODE, ferocity shaping, and ONDAS gating. Let me build one in Ruby — it can output CSV for plotting or render directly.\",\"args\":null,\"result\":null},{\"id\":\"call_00_6TnNOOmDUPlBbgQM0GNF8266\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"result\":{\"content\":\"\\n\\nstatic inline float ferocityParamToFloat(int8_t param) {\\n    return 1.0f + ((float)(param - 1) * 7.0f / 99.0f);\\n}\\n\\nstatic void applyFerocityWaveShaping(float sinTheta) {\\n    float fDown = ferocityParamToFloat(servoConfig()->ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke);\\n    float fUp   = ferocityParamToFloa...\",\"range\":[582,665],\"execution_time\":0.019},\"args\":{\"path\":\"src/main/flight/pid.c\",\"range\":[583,665]},\"execution_time\":0.02},{\"id\":\"call_01_jLfk1SXmpHcLKO7kvInA5076\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"result\":{\"content\":\"static FAST_RAM_ZERO_INIT float flappingSinusoid;\\nstatic FAST_RAM_ZERO_INIT float flappingSinusoid2;\\nstatic FAST_RAM_ZERO_INIT float flappingCosinusoid;\\nstatic FAST_RAM_ZERO_INIT float flappingAmplitude;\\nFAST_RAM_ZERO_INIT float ornithopterFlapping;\\nstatic FAST_RAM_ZERO_INIT float ondasAttenuatio...\",\"range\":[87,125],\"execution_time\":0.008},\"args\":{\"path\":\"src/main/flight/pid.c\",\"range\":[88,125]},\"execution_time\":0.008},{\"id\":\"call_02_O4Y0bhVHa8KxTud2WQNS0933\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"result\":{\"content\":\"#else\\n    const float tpaFactorKp = tpaFactor;\\n#endif\\n\\n#ifdef USE_YAW_SPIN_RECOVERY\\n    const bool yawSpinActive = gyroYawSpinDetected();\\n#endif\\n\\n    const bool launchControlActive = isLaunchControlActive();\\n\\n#if defined(USE_ACC)\\n    const bool gpsRescueIsActive = FLIGHT_MODE(GPS_RESCUE_MODE);\\n  ...\",\"range\":[1399,1520],\"execution_time\":0.023},\"args\":{\"path\":\"src/main/flight/pid.c\",\"range\":[1400,1520]},\"execution_time\":0.023},{\"content\":\"\",\"args\":null,\"result\":null},{\"id\":\"call_00_IKe3JUiZEFCcp6fFNPDu7381\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"result\":{\"content\":\"        \\n        // apply only on PITCH axis for now. attenuation of filter can be tuned.\\n        if (axis == FD_PITCH) {\\n\\n            // --------introduce ONDAS alpha filter. -----------------------------------\\n            errorRate *= (1.0 + ((ondasAttenuation - 0.5) * (float)servoConfig()->ond...\",\"range\":[1519,1590],\"execution_time\":0.015},\"args\":{\"path\":\"src/main/flight/pid.c\",\"range\":[15