 modulation), feedForwardCorrection() (never called), ondasAuthority variable (computed but unused). Anti-gravity runtime neutered under #ifndef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY guards — function signatures kept for callers (rc.c, osd), internals no-op. Propeller features #undef'd in common_pre.h: USE_DSHOT, USE_DSHOT_TELEMETRY, USE_RPM_FILTER, USE_BRUSHED_ESC_AUTODETECT, USE_LAUNCH_CONTROL, USE_THROTTLE_BOOST, USE_SMART_FEEDFORWARD, USE_INTEGRATED_YAW_CONTROL. common_post.h cascades: undef DSHOT → undef ESC_SENSOR, DSHOT_TELEMETRY, RPM_FILTER.", :tags=>["code", "cleanup", "dead-code", "anti-gravity", "betaflight", "ornithopter"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/target/common_pre.h", "src/main/fc/rc.c"]}, :execution_time=>0.006}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_JVlwrU1Unvn6MsQK6E7P8264", :name=>"aegis", :result=>{:aegis_notes=>[{:id=>11, :content=>"Three-channel breathing-pause architecture in pid.c — PID terms modulate wing-trajectory parameters, not servo offset:\n\nChannel 1: P-term → phase advance via k0 scaling. \"Push harder now.\" `flappingPhaseModulation = 1.0 + P * ondas_gain * 0.00005`, clamped [0.5, 2.0]. Applied as `k0 * modulation` in wing ODE. Compresses/stretches current ramp.\n\nChannel 2: D-term → ferocity (wave sharpness). \"Delay next opposite stroke.\" `flappingFerocityModulation = D * ondas_gain2 * 0.0003`, clamped [-0.5, 0.5]...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,pid,architecture,three-channel,breathing-pause", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 13:55:53", :score=>59}, {:id=>12, :content=>"Ferocity wave-shaping in pid.c: `applyFerocityWaveShaping(sinTheta, dMod, iBias)` computes tanh(F·sinθ)/tanh(F). Now accepts 2 additional params: dMod (D-term ferocity modulation factor, scales both fDown/fUp equally for breathing pause depth) and iBias (I-term asymmetry, adds to fUp, subtracts from fDown). SSFF biases still added before these. Per-stroke ferocity with ±0.1 rad blend zone. Clamped [1.0, 8.0]. Phase ODE: θ̈=k₀·P_mod·T_cmd−k₂·ω where P_mod = flappingPhaseModulation ∈ [0.5, 2.0]. O...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,architecture,three-channel", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 13:56:09", :score=>38}, {:id=>8, :content=>"Simulation harness at sim_ferocity.rb with 3 modes: wave (static wave shape at given ferocity), flight (full wing ODE + airframe + PID pitch dynamics), sweep (parameter scan over ferocity combinations). Key findings: F=1.0 (pure sine) gives symmetric thrust with minimal pitch disturbance; balanced ferocity (F_down≈F_up≈5-6) minimizes pitch amplitude; higher ferocity (>7) narrows ONDAS window but increases pitch oscillation slightly. Wing ODE: θ̈=k₀·T_cmd−k₂·ω with θ modulo 2π. Airframe: 1st-orde...", :tags=>"simulation,ferocity,ondas,code", :links=>"sim_ferocity.rb,src/main/flight/pid.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 02:03:10", :score=>25}, {:id=>13, :content=>"Dead code removed from pid.c: applyPhaseShift() (old ONDAS phase-shifting, competed with new k0 modulation), feedForwardCorrection() (never called), ondasAuthority variable (computed but unused). Anti-gravity runtime neutered under #ifndef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY guards — function signatures kept for callers (rc.c, osd), internals no-op. Propeller features #undef'd in common_pre.h: USE_DSHOT, USE_DSHOT_TELEMETRY, USE_RPM_FILTER, USE_BRUSHED_ESC_AUTODETECT, USE_LAUNCH_CONTROL, USE_THROTTLE_BOOST, USE...", :tags=>"code,cleanup,dead-code,anti-gravity,betaflight,ornithopter", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/target/common_pre.h,src/main/fc/rc.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 18:05:47", :score=>15}, {:id=>5, :content=>"Gralha Azul (RP2040) ferocity formula in formaDoBaterDasAsas(): shapedWave = tanh(ferocity * sin(θ)) / tanh(ferocity). Ferocity per channel: downstroke (CH7, 1.0-8.0), upstroke (CH8, 1.0-8.0), with linear blend zone ±0.1 rad at zero crossing. Low ferocity → pure sine; high ferocity → near square wave (earlier movement, longer at extreme). Wave always normalized to [-1,+1]. Servo rate limiting in glide: ferocity controls transition speed. Constants: FEROCIDADE_MINIMA_PADRAO=1.0, FEROCIDADE_MAXIMA...", :tags=>"ferocity,code,formula,gralha-azul", :links=>"~~/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/src/GralhaAzul.h~~ (path not found),~~/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/src/GralhaAzul_Padraos.h~~ (path not found)", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 01:34:07", :score=>11}, {:id=>1, :content=>"OrniFlight: open-source flight control for servo-flapping ornithopters, forked from Betaflight 4.0.6. FORKNAME=orniflight. GPL v3 licensed. Key innovation: ONDAS (Oscillating Normalized Dynamic Adaptive Stabilization) for flapping-wing flight dynamics.\n\nProject structure: src/main/ with standard Betaflight layout — flight/, fc/, drivers/, sensors/, io/, cli/, msp/, rx/, osd/, telemetry/, pg/, config/. Build via Makefile targeting STM32F3/F4/F7 MCUs.", :tags=>"code,structure,overview", :links=>"README.md,Makefile,src/main/flight/", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 01:17:15", :score=>4}], :aegis_orientation=>{:tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "three-channel", "breathing-pause"], :summary=>"Dead ONDAS code removed (applyPhaseShift, feedForwardCorrection, ondasAuthority). Anti-gravity neutered via #ifndef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY. 8 propeller features #undef'd in common_pre.h. Build passes at 99.43% flash.", :temperature=>1.0, :working_dir=>nil, :thinking=>nil}, :execution_time=>0.008}, :args=>{:summary=>"Dead ONDAS code removed (applyPhaseShift, feedForwardCorrection, ondasAuthority). Anti-gravity neutered via #ifndef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY. 8 propeller features #undef'd in common_pre.h. Build passes at 99.43% flash."}, :execution_time=>0.009}]
