:        return ((rc_throttle - GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD) * 0.04) \nsrc/main/flight/servos.c:368:  if (rcData[THROTTLE] &gt; GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD) {\nsrc/main/pg/pg.h:201:#define GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD 1040\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.299}, :args=>{:cmd=>"grep -rn \"GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD\" src/main/ --include=\"*.h\" --include=\"*.c\" | head -20"}, :execution_time=>0.3}, {:content=>"Found it — `GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD = 1040` in `pg.h`. Now let me write the foundational memory structures and complete the Nigredo phase."}, {:id=>"call_00_aoVpm77WR7pS5ubwwQMR1285", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:error=>#<SQLite3::SQLException: no such column: updated_at>, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:content=>"OrniFlight project: fork of Betaflight 4.0.6 for servo-flapping ornithopters. FORKNAME=orniflight, GPLv3. Build targets STM32F3/F4/F7 (F7 primary with USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY). Build system: Makefile with TARGET, cross-compiled arm-none-eabi-gcc, LTO + -Ofast. Version from build/version.h. Key directories: src/main/flight/ (pid, mixer, servos), src/main/fc/ (rc, runtime_config), src/main/cli/ (settings), src/main/target/ (common_pre.h, common_post.h), src/main/pg/ (parameter groups). Flash at 99.43% on F7 target. Simulation harness: sim_ferocity.rb (Ruby, 6 modes). Docs: ONDAS.md.", :tags=>["code", "structure", "overview", "project-identity"], :links=>["README.md", "Makefile", "src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/servos.c", "src/main/flight/mixer.c", "ONDAS.md", "sim_ferocity.rb", "src/main/target/common_pre.h", "src/main/pg/pg.h"], :id=>1}, :execution_time=>0.002}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_nGqCxWSBazauE62XPGEP7607", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.005}, :args=>{:content=>"OrniFlight project: fork of Betaflight 4.0.6 for servo-flapping ornithopters. FORKNAME=orniflight, GPLv3. Build targets STM32F3/F4/F7 (F7 primary with USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY). Build system: Makefile with TARGET, cross-compiled arm-none-eabi-gcc, LTO + -Ofast. Version from build/version.h. Key directories: src/main/flight/ (pid, mixer, servos), src/main/fc/ (rc, runtime_config), src/main/cli/ (settings), src/main/target/ (common_pre.h, common_post.h), src/main/pg/ (parameter groups). Flash at 99.43% on F7 target. Simulation harness: sim_ferocity.rb (Ruby, 6 modes). Docs: ONDAS.md.", :tags=>["code", "structure", "overview", "project-identity"], :links=>["README.md", "Makefile", "src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/servos.c", "src/main/flight/mixer.c", "ONDAS.md", "sim_ferocity.rb", "src/main/target/common_pre.h", "src/main/pg/pg.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.005}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_HvPoX0o2HScxGOGh4Bkd2137", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.004}, :args=>{:content=>"Wing ODE in pid.c: θ̈ = k₀·T_cmd − k₂·ω with θ modulo 2π. k₀=1.0, k₂=10.0 (hardcoded globals). T_cmd computed from RC throttle: tcommand = (rc_throttle - 480.0) * ((1.0/(0.1*flap_base_frequency)) + ((flap_speed_modificator - 1500) * 0.000725)). Phase ODE integrated via explicit Euler: θ += ω·dT, ω += ω̇·dT. Flapping derived as sin(θ) then shaped by ferocity wave. When throttle > GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD(1040): normal flapping. Below: zero flapping (glide). Flapping amplitude: ((throttle - 1040) * 0.04) * flap_base_amplitude * 0.1 * (1 - (flap_speed_mod - 1500)*0.003).", :tags=>["code", "wing-ode", "pid", "physics", "architecture"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/pid.h", "src/main/pg/pg.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.004}, {:id=>"call_01_g88X0Vem4S2gOwNw80Bp9397", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:content=>"Three-channel breathing-pause modulation in pid.c PID loop (PITCH axis only): P-term→phase advance via k0 scaling: flappingPhaseModulation = 1.0 + P * ondas_gain * 0.00005, clamped [0.5, 2.0]. Applied as k0 * modulation in wing ODE. D-term→ferocity wave sharpness: flappingFerocityModulation = D * ondas_gain2 * 0.0003, clamped [-0.5, 0.5]. Applied as dMod in applyFerocityWaveShaping(). I-term→up/down asymmetry: flappingAsymmetryBias = I * ondas_gain3 * 0.0001, clamped [-3.0, 3.0]. Applied as iBias in applyFerocityWaveShaping(). Values stored for next calculateFlappingFromThrottle call (one-frame lag). Each channel has independent gain parameter (ondas_gain/gain2/gain3) with zero-disabling. P-term and I-term also routed through aeroelastic PID gain adjustment.", :tags=>["code", "ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "three-channel", "breathing-pause"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/servos.h", "src/main/cli/settings.c"]}, :execution_time=>0.002}, {:id=>"call_02_JBQeegfpfHVNvAsCoc8m9611", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:content=>"Ferocity wave-shaping in pid.c: applyFerocityWaveShaping(sinTheta, dMod, iBias) computes per-stroke ferocity. fDown = ferocityParamToFloat(ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke) + ssffFerocityDownBias - iBias; fUp similarly with +iBias. dMod (D-term factor 1.0+dMod) scales both equally. ferocityParamToFloat: 1.0 + (param-1)*7.0/99.0 → maps [1,100]→[1.0,8.0]. Ferocity per-stroke with ±0.1 rad blend zone (sinθ crossover). shapedWave = tanh(F·sinθ)/tanh(F), clamped [-1,1]. Also computes shapedDerivative = F·cosθ·sech²(F·sinθ)·ω / tanh(F) for aeroelastic scaling. SSFF biases (fDown/fUp) added before D-term scaling and clamping.", :tags=>["code", "ferocity", "wave-shaping", "physics"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/servos.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.002}, {:id=>"call_03_dedV36KVyR4bp0hB3Ie69212", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:content=>"SSFF (Stroke-Synchronous Feed-Forward) in pid.c: measures pitch errorRate over each half-stroke, biases next stroke's ferocity. applyStrokeSynchronousFF(pitchErrorRate) called on PITCH axis. Detects sinθ zero crossing: when prevSin * sin <= 0 and they differ → half-stroke boundary. Computes mean error = ssffAccumError/ssffAccumCount. If prevSin > 0 (finished downstroke): ssffFerocityUpBias = ssff_gain * 0.001 * meanError. If prevSin < 0 (finished upstroke): ssffFerocityDownBias = -ssff_gain * 0.001 * meanError. Resets accumulators each boundary. Biases applied to fDown/fUp in applyFerocityWaveShaping before clamp. ssff_gain=0 disables (default). Simulation shows SSFF reduces pitch RMS and I-term windup vs fixed ferocity.", :tags=>["code", "ssff", "feed-forward", "ferocity", "pid"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "sim_ferocity.rb", "ONDAS.md"]}, :execution_time=>0.002}, {:id=>"call_04_U01Zx4Rhm0fs2RicIAho0200", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:content=>"Aeroelastic PID gain adjustment in pid.c: adjustAerolasticPIDGains(errorRate, &Kp, &Ki, &Kd). Two components: (1) glide_aeroelasticity = sign(errorRate) * aeroelastic_glide_coefficient, representing wing-position-dependent stiffness change; (2) flap_aeroelasticity = flappingDerivative * aeroelastic_flap_coefficient * 0.001, representing wing-velocity-dependent damping. Gains adjusted: Kp *= 1 + (glide_ael * 0.01 - flap_ael * 0.01), Ki *= 1 + (glide_ael * 0.005 - flap_ael * 0.005), Kd *= 1 + (glide_ael * -0.005 - flap_ael * -0.005). Hardcoded scaling constants: aerolastic_Kp_scaling=0.01, Ki=0.005, Kd=-0.005. Called on PITCH axis only in PID loop, before low-level P/I/D computation.", :tags=>["code", "aeroelastic", "pid", "physics"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/servos.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.003}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_ljLqCFxMNHUdwzj5Fgf48007", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:content=>"servoConfig_t (PG_SERVO_CONFIG) holds all orni-specific parameters. Defaults: flap_base_frequency=12, flap_base_amplitude=60, ornithopter_glide_deg=-30, ondas_gain=20 (P→phase advance), ondas_gain2=20 (D→ferocity), ondas_gain3=10 (I→asymmetry), aeroelastic_glide_coefficient=40, aeroelastic_flap_coefficient=40, ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke=12 (~1.78F), ornithopter_ferocity_upstroke=12, ssff_gain=0 (off). Also: dev.servoCenterPulse=1500, dev.servoPwmRate=50, servo_lowpass_freq=0, tri_unarmed_servo=1, channel_forwarding_start_channel=AUX1. All exposed via CLI with range [-100,100] except ferocity [1,100] and ssff_gain [0,100]. Note: ONDAS.md describes ondas_gain2 as \"I-term scaling factor\" but code uses ondas_gain3 for I-term — possible doc bug.", :tags=>["code", "servo", "config", "parameters", "ornithopter"], :links=>["src/main/flight/servos.h", "src/main/flight/servos.c", "src/main/cli/settings.c"]}, :execution_time=>0.002}, {:id=>"call_01_1F1ghiBEfJjD2mQq8IO35823", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.001}, :args=>{:content=>"Servo mixer for ornithopter (servos.c): servoMixerOrni[] with 6 rules for 2 flapping servos (SERVO_ORNITHOPTER_1,2). Rules 0-2→servo1 (channel 3): INPUT_STABILIZED_ROLL +100, INPUT_STABILIZED_PITCH +100, INPUT_STABILIZED_FLAPPING_0 +100. Rules 3-5→servo2 (channel 4): INPUT_STABILIZED_YAW +100, INPUT_STABILIZED_PITCH +100, INPUT_STABILIZED_FLAPPING_1 +100. Commented-out rules for 4-servo config (SERVO_ORNITHOPTER_3,4 with FLAPPING_2,3). applyFlappingToServos(): when throttle > GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD: FLAPPING_i = (ornithopterFlapping/100) * (motor[i] - 1000). Else glide: FLAPPING_i = ornithopter_glide_deg * 5. mixerOrnithopter[] in mixer.c: 4-motors with QuadX-like mixing (1,1,-1,-1 etc). MIXER_SERVO_ORNITHOPTER = 27.", :tags=>["code", "servo", "mixer", "ornithopter", "glide", "architecture"], :links=>["src/main/flight/servos.c", "src/main/flight/mixer.c", "src/main/flight/mixer.h", "src/main/flight/servos.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.001}, {:id=>"call_02_BbZwqJOymjgIyEq6vBHH7004", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.001}, :args=>{:content=>"Feature defines in common_pre.h: USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY enabled for FLASH_SIZE > 256 (i.e., F7 targets). Under this guard, the following are #undef'd: USE_DSHOT, USE_DSHOT_TELEMETRY, USE_RPM_FILTER, USE_BRUSHED_ESC_AUTODETECT, USE_LAUNCH_CONTROL, USE_THROTTLE_BOOST, USE_SMART_FEEDFORWARD, USE_INTEGRATED_YAW_CONTROL. Additional features disabled via comment-out: USE_RUNAWAY_TAKEOFF, USE_YAW_SPIN_RECOVERY, USE_GPS, USE_GPS_RESCUE, USE_ABSOLUTE_CONTROL. common_post.h cascades: removing DSHOT removes ESC_SENSOR, RPM_FILTER. Removing DSHOT_TELEMETRY removes RPM_FILTER. I2C dependencies clean up display/dashboard. ACC removal drops GPS_RESCUE, ACRO_TRAINER. ITERM_RELAX required for ABSOLUTE_CONTROL.", :tags=>["code", "feature-defines", "build", "configuration"], :links=>["src/main/target/common_pre.h", "src/main/target/common_post.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.001}, {:id=>"call_03_Nesgtwr9yrDKLp7llQFR2150", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.001}, :args=>{:content=>"PID flow in pidController(): (1) Pre-calc gyro D-term with RPM filter + notch + dual lowpass cascade. (2) Init flapping amplitude via getFlappingAmplitude(throttle_*1000+1000). (3) calculateFlappingFromThrottle(): wing ODE step + ferocity wave shaping, populates ornithopterFlapping/shapedFlappingSinusoid. (4) Per-axis loop: setpoint rate → accel limit → level/horizon modes → acro trainer → launch control → yaw spin recovery → error rate. (5) On PITCH: applyStrokeSynchronousFF(errorRate) → three-channel modulation (P→k0, D→ferocity, I→asymmetry) → adjustAerolasticPIDGains. (6) Per-axis PID: P=Kp*errorRate, I+=Ki*itermError*dynCi, D=Kd*delta*pidFrequency, F=Kf*transition*setpointDelta*pidFrequency. (7) pidData[axis].Sum = P+I+D+F. Note: D for PITCH not attenuated by wing velocity (routes through ferocity instead).", :tags=>["code", "pid", "flow", "architecture", "control-loop"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/pid.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.001}, {:id=>"call_04_4kRiglI3EKaRqPjCOxnS7467", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.001}, :args=>{:content=>"Anti-gravity runtime neutered under USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY in pid.c: pidOsdAntiGravityActive() returns false, pidSetAntiGravityState() no-ops, pidAntiGravityEnabled() returns false, pidSetItermAccelerator() no-ops, antiGravityMode forced to 0. Throttle-based anti-gravity computation and antiGravityThrottleLpf init all guarded by #ifndef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY. Function signatures kept for callers (rc.c, osd). In resetPidProfile: antiGravityMode defaults to ANTI_GRAVITY_SMOOTH only when USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY not defined, else 0. antiGravityOsdCutoff forced to 1.0f.", :tags=>["code", "anti-gravity", "cleanup", "dead-code"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/pid.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.001}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_1VdFPyNCefHYINDrATwU4412", :name=>"task_read_file", :result=>{:content=>"/*\n * This file is part of Cleanflight and Betaflight.\n *\n * Cleanflight and Betaflight are free software. You can redistribute\n * this software and/or modify this software under the terms of the\n * GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software\n * Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or (at your option)\n * any later version.\n *\n * Cleanflight and Betaflight are distributed in the hope that they\n * will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied\n * warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.\n * See the GNU General Public License for more details.\n *\n * You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License\n * along with this software.\n *\n * If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\n */\n\n#pragma once\n\n#include <stdint.h>\n\n#include \"pg/pg.h\"\n\ntypedef enum {\n    RATES_TYPE_BETAFLIGHT = 0,\n    RATES_TYPE_RACEFLIGHT,\n} ratesType_e;\n\ntypedef enum {\n    THROTTLE_LIMIT_TYPE_OFF = 0,\n    THROTTLE_LIMIT_TYPE_SCALE,\n    THROTTLE_LIMIT_TYPE_CLIP,\n    THROTTLE_LIMIT_TYPE_COUNT   // must be the last entry\n} throttleLimitType_e;\n\n\ntypedef enum {\n    TPA_MODE_PD,\n    TPA_MODE_D\n} tpaMode_e;\n\ntypedef struct controlRateConfig_s {\n    uint8_t thrMid8;\n    uint8_t thrExpo8;\n    uint8_t rates_type;\n    uint8_t rcRates[3];\n    uint8_t rcExpo[3];\n    uint8_t rates[3];\n    uint8_t dynThrPID;\n    uint16_t flap_speed_modificator;\n    int8_t phase_shift_scale;\n    uint16_t tpa_breakpoint;                // Breakpoint where TPA is activated\n    uint8_t throttle_limit_type;            // Sets the throttle limiting type - off, scale or clip\n    uint8_t throttle_limit_percent;         // Sets the maximum pilot commanded throttle limit\n    uint16_t rate_limit[3];                 // Sets the maximum rate for the axes\n    uint8_t tpaMode;                        // Controls which PID terms TPA effects\n} controlRateConfig_t;\n\nPG_DECLARE_ARRAY(controlRateConfig_t, CONTROL_RATE_PROFILE_COUNT, controlRateProfiles);\n\nextern controlRateConfig_t *currentControlRateProfile;\n\nvoid loadControlRateProfile(void);\nvoid changeControlRateProfile(uint8_t controlRateProfileIndex);\n\nvoid copyControlRateProfile(const uint8_t dstControlRateProfileIndex, const uint8_t srcControlRateProfileIndex);\n", :task_id=>2, :execution_time=>0.004}, :args=>{:path=>"src/main/fc/controlrate_profile.h"}, :execution_time=>0.004}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_izzxRcex80vTwSzS4tHZ2872", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.001}, :args=>{:content=>"controlRateConfig_t (PG_CONTROL_RATE_PROFILES) contains 2 orni-specific fields: flap_speed_modificator (uint16, default PWM mid ~1500, CLI range [PWM_MIN, PWM_MAX]) — adjusts flap frequency via tcommand formula, and phase_shift_scale (int8, default 0) — legacy ONDAS phase shift parameter, still present but may be unused after three-channel migration. Standard fields: thrMid8, thrExpo8, rates_type, rcRates[3], rcExpo[3], rates[3] (super-rates), dynThrPID (TPA), tpa_breakpoint, throttle_limit_type/percent, rate_limit[3], tpaMode. CONTROL_RATE_PROFILE_COUNT=6 (>128K flash). Profiles selectable at runtime. Used in pid.c tcommand calculation and getFlappingAmplitude.", :tags=>["code", "config", "parameters", "rates", "control"], :links=>["src/main/fc/controlrate_profile.h", "src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/cli/settings.c"]}, :execution_time=>0.002}, {:id=>"call_01_zdo1dzTVFYb0JN9tCQUQ7430", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.001}, :args=>{:content=>"sim_ferocity.rb: Ruby simulation harness with 6 modes. Mode wave: static wave shape analysis over 360° cycle. Mode flight: full wing ODE + airframe (1st-order pitch dynamics, I_YY=0.02, PITCH_DAMP=0.3) + PID (Kp=8.0, Ki=0.5, Kd=2.0) + ONDAS gate + ferocity + SSFF. Mode sweep: parameter scan over F_down × F_up grid (11×11) measuring RMS pitch/rate. Mode compare: fixed vs SSFF side-by-side. Mode derive: velocity amplification by ferocity at each phase. Mode prize: full theory demonstration. Wing ODE matches firmware: K0=80.0, K2=10.0. Thrust ∝ velocity² with THRUST_COEFF=0.08. Gust injection at configurable time. Uses param_to_f() mapping matching firmware ferocityParamToFloat().", :tags=>["code", "simulation", "ferocity", "ondas", "ssff", "ruby"], :links=>["sim_ferocity.rb", "src/main/flight/pid.c", "ONDAS.md"]}, :execution_time=>0.001}, {:id=>"call_02_yECWkPbJpBxw77zfFwG09446", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.001}, :args=>{:content=>"Mixer architecture: mixTable() is the main mixer entry. For ornithopter with USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY, motorCount=4, uses mixerOrnithopter[] table (QuadX-like). PID sums scaled and mixed to 4 virtual motors: motorMix[i] = scaledAxisPidRoll*roll + ...Pitch*pitch + ...Yaw*yaw. Throttle from rcCommand, with throttle_limit, airmode, throttle_boost, voltage compensation, thrust_linearization. motor[i] written to pwm. Servo side: servoMixer() computes INPUT_STABILIZED_FLAPPING_i from ornithopterFlapping * (motor[i]-1000)/100. Servo outputs combined: stabilized roll/pitch/yaw + flapping signal. Glide path: when throttle < 1040, flapping signal replaced by glide_deg*5. Servo outputs written via writeServos() which routes MIXER_SERVO_ORNITHOPTER to SERVO_ORNITHOPTER_1..4.", :tags=>["code", "mixer", "servo", "architecture", "data-flow"], :links=>["src/main/flight/mixer.c", "src/main/flight/mixer.h", "src/main/flight/servos.c", "src/main/flight/servos.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.001}, {:id=>"call_03_gMAMdbX8QYV4lsHwIrdQ6914", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.001}, :args=>{:content=>"CLI orni-specific parameters at end of valueTable[] in settings.c: flap_base_frequency (uint8, [0,255]), flap_base_amplitude (int8, [-128,127]), ornithopter_glide_deg (int8, [-128,127]), ondas_gain/gain2/gain3 (int8, [-100,100]), aeroelastic_glide_coefficient/aeroelastic_flap_coefficient (int8, full range), ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke/upstroke (int8, [1,100]), ssff_gain (int8, [0,100]). All in PG_SERVO_CONFIG. Earlier servo config: servo_center_pulse, servo_pwm_rate, servo_lowpass_hz, tri_unarmed_servo, channel_forwarding_start. flap_speed_modificator and phase_shift_scale in PG_CONTROL_RATE_PROFILES (PROFILE_RATE_VALUE). All exposed as MASTER_VALUE except rate-profile items. No MSP exposure gaps identified — all orni params have CLI entries.", :tags=>["code", "cli", "parameters", "config"], :links=>["src/main/cli/settings.c", "src/main/flight/servos.h", "src/main/fc/controlrate_profile.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.001}, {:content=>"Now let me complete the Nigredo phase with a comprehensive result."}]
