d", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: 287:#define USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY\n307:// OrniFlight: strip propeller-oriented Betaflight features not needed for ornithopters\n308:#ifdef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.079}, :args=>{:cmd=>"grep -n \"ORNI\\|orni\\|FLAPPING\\|flapping\\|GLIDE\\|glide\\|FEROCITY\\|ferocity\\|ONDAS\\|ondas\\|ornithopter\\|ORNITHOPTER\" src/main/target/common_pre.h"}, :execution_time=>0.079}, {:id=>"call_01_P0DEtw39XWBQ0Kawge3p1763", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>1, :result=>"Command output: (exit 1)", :execution_time=>0.082}, :args=>{:cmd=>"grep -n \"ORNI\\|orni\\|FLAPPING\\|flapping\\|GLIDE\\|glide\" src/main/target/common_post.h 2>/dev/null"}, :execution_time=>0.083}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_QbpuMEh1t1c7w0oS3kP31444", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: // OrniFlight: strip propeller-oriented Betaflight features not needed for ornithopters\n#ifdef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY\n#undef USE_DSHOT\n#undef USE_DSHOT_TELEMETRY\n#undef USE_RPM_FILTER\n#undef USE_BRUSHED_ESC_AUTODETECT\n#undef USE_LAUNCH_CONTROL\n#undef USE_THROTTLE_BOOST\n#undef USE_SMART_FEEDFORWARD\n#undef USE_INTEGRATED_YAW_CONTROL\n#endif\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.07}, :args=>{:cmd=>"sed -n '307,320p' src/main/target/common_pre.h"}, :execution_time=>0.07}, {:content=>"Now I have all the data. Time to crystallize the **Rubedo** — the philosopher's stone.\n\n---\n\n## Rubedo: The Philosopher's Stone\n\n### 1. Technical Specifications\n\n#### 1.1 File Structure\n\n```\nmagnum_opus/\n├── 00_INDEX.md              (~50 lines)\n├── 01_ARCHITECTURE.md       (~400 lines, 3 Mermaid diagrams)\n├── 02_CONTROL_THEORY.md     (~550 lines, 12+ LaTeX equations)\n├── 03_PARAMETER_SPACE.md    (~400 lines, 4 grouped tables, 1 interaction matrix)\n├── 04_IDENTITY.md           (~200 lines)\n├── 05_CRITIQUE.md           (~450 lines, evidence-linked weaknesses)\n├── 06_IMPROVEMENT_VISION.md (~350 lines, 4-horizon roadmap)\n└── 07_SIMULATION.md         (~300 lines, 6-mode analysis)\n```\n\n#### 1.2 Formatting Stack (Zero External Dependencies)\n\n| Element | Syntax | Rendering |\n|---------|--------|-----------|\n| Math | `$inline$`, `$$display$$` | LaTeX (TextMate built-in) |\n| Diagrams | ````mermaid` blocks | Mermaid (TextMate popup) |\n| File refs | `<file>path:line</file>` | Clickable TextMate links |\n| Code | ````c` / ````ruby` fenced blocks | Syntax highlighted |\n| Tables | GitHub-flavored Markdown | Rendered in preview |\n| Cross-refs | `[DOC.md#anchor](desc)` | Relative Markdown links |\n\n#### 1.3 Mermaid Diagram Specifications\n\n**Diagram 1: Component Graph** (`01_ARCHITECTURE.md`)\n```\nflowchart TB\n    subgraph Sensors\n        GYRO[Gyro/IMU] --> FILTER[Filter Cascade: RPM+Notch+Lowpass×2]\n    end\n    subgraph Control\n        FILTER --> PID[PID Controller]\n        RC[RC Throttle] --> FLAP[calculateFlappingFromThrottle]\n        FLAP --> ODE[Wing ODE: θ̈=k₀·T−k₂·ω]\n        ODE --> FEROCITY[applyFerocityWaveShaping]\n        FEROCITY --> SHAPED[shapedFlappingSinusoid]\n        PID -->|PITCH axis| ONDAS{Three-Channel Modulation}\n        ONDAS -->|P→k₀| ODE\n        ONDAS -->|D→ferocity| FEROCITY\n        ONDAS -->|I→asymmetry| FEROCITY\n        PID -->|PITCH error| SSFF[SSFF: Half-Stroke Error Accum]\n        SSFF -->|bias| FEROCITY\n    end\n    subgraph Output\n        PID --> MIXER[mixTable]\n        SHAPED --> SERVO_MIX[servoMixerOrni]\n        MIXER --> SERVO_MIX\n        SERVO_MIX --> PWM[Servo PWM]\n    end\n```\n\n**Diagram 2: Data Flow Sequence** (`01_ARCHITECTURE.md`)\n```\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Gyro\n    participant PID as pidController()\n    participant Flap as calcFlappingFromThrottle()\n    participant Servo as applyFlappingToServos()\n\n    Gyro->>PID: filtered gyro[3] @8kHz\n    PID->>PID: D-term pre-calc + notch + lowpass\n    PID->>Flap: getFlappingAmplitude(throttle)\n    Flap->>Flap: Wing ODE step (θ̈=k₀T−k₂ω)\n    Flap->>Flap: Ferocity wave shaping (tanh)\n    Flap-->>PID: ornithopterFlapping, shapedFlappingSinusoid\n    loop Per Axis (ROLL/PITCH/YAW)\n        PID->>PID: setpoint → accel limit → error rate\n        alt PITCH axis\n            PID->>PID: SSFF + 3-channel modulation\n        end\n        PID->>PID: P/I/D compute → pidData[axis].Sum\n    end\n    PID->>Servo: motor[i] values\n    Servo->>Servo: input = orniFlapping/100 × (motor[i]-1000)\n    Servo->>Servo: servo lowpass + writeServos()\n```\n\n**Diagram 3: Glide Mode State Machine** (`01_ARCHITECTURE.md`)\n```\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Flapping: throttle ≥ 1040\n    Flapping --> Glide: throttle < 1040\n    Glide --> Flapping: throttle ≥ 1040\n    \n    state Flapping {\n        [*] --> WingODE\n        WingODE --> FerocityShaping\n        FerocityShaping --> PIDActive\n    }\n    \n    state Glide {\n        [*] --> HoldGlideAngle\n        HoldGlideAngle --> PIDSuppressed\n    }\n```\n\n#### 1.4 Cross-Reference Schema\n\n```markdown\n[01_ARCHITECTURE.md](#system-overview) — internal anchor\n[02_CONTROL_THEORY.md#wing-ode](the Wing ODE) — descriptive internal\n<file>src/main/flight/pid.c:1200</file> — code location\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Implementation Chunks & Dependencies\n\n```\nChunk 1: 02_CONTROL_THEORY.md           [Foundation — no deps]\n    │\n    ├──▶ Chunk 2a: 03_PARAMETER_SPACE   [depends on 02 for semantics]\n    │\n    ├──▶ Chunk 2b: 01_ARCHITECTURE      [depends on 02 for data flow accuracy]\n    │         │\n    │         └──▶ Chunk 3a: 04_IDENTITY [depends on 01 for structural identity]\n    │\n    └──▶ Chunk 2c: 07_SIMULATION        [depends on 02 for physics mapping]\n    \n    [SYNC POINT: Chunks 2a, 2b, 2c complete]\n    │\n    └──▶ Chunk 4: 05_CRITIQUE           [depends on all above for evidence]\n              │\n              └──▶ Chunk 5: 06_IMPROVEMENT_VISION  [depends on 05 for problems]\n                        │\n                        └──▶ Chunk 6: 00_INDEX     [last, once all exist]\n```\n\n**Parallelizable**: Chunks 2a, 2b, and 2c can execute simultaneously after Chunk 1 completes.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Document Content Signatures\n\n#### 02_CONTROL_THEORY.md — Content Blocks\n\n| Block | Lines | Key Content |\n|-------|-------|-------------|\n| Wing ODE | ~60 | Derivation, discretization, k₀/k₂ sensitivity, phase modulo 2π |\n| Ferocity Wave Shaping | ~70 | `tanh(F·sinθ)/tanh(F)` derivation, normalization proof, per-stroke blend zone (±0.1 rad), clamp [1.0, 8.0] |\n| Three-Channel Modulation | ~90 | P→k₀ (0.00005 scale), D→ferocity (0.0003 scale), I→asymmetry (0.0001 scale), range analysis, saturation behavior |\n| SSFF | ~50 | Zero-crossing detection, half-stroke accumulation, ±gain bias on fDown/fUp |\n| Aeroelastic Gain | ~40 | Glide/flap coefficient blending, thrust-adaptive gain surface |\n| Transfer Function | ~60 | Complete closed-loop symbolic form, stability margins |\n| Regime Comparison | ~50 | Old single-channel ONDAS gate vs current three-channel, sim-vs-firmware gap analysis |\n| Numerical Analysis | ~60 | Sweep data: 11×11 ferocity grid, balanced F≈5-6 optimal, oscillation modes |\n\n#### 03_PARAMETER_SPACE.md — Table Signatures\n\n4 grouped tables + 1 interaction matrix + 1 MSP gap table:\n\n**Table: Flapping Physics Group**\n| CLI Name | Type | Range | Default | MSP? | Description | Interacts With |\n|----------|------|-------|---------|------|-------------|----------------|\n| `flap_base_frequency` | UINT8 | [1,50] | 12 | ❌ | Base flapping frequency (Hz) into ODE | ferocity_* (blend zone timing) |\n| `flap_base_amplitude` | UINT8 | [1,100] | 60 | ❌ | Wing amplitude scaling (percent) | ornithopter_glide_deg |\n| `ornithopter_glide_deg` | INT8 | [-90,90] | -30 | ✅ (MSP2) | Servo angle in glide mode | GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD=1040 |\n| `flap_speed_modificator` | UINT16 | [0,10000] | 0 | ❌ | Frequency trim multiplier | flap_base_frequency |\n\n**Table: Ferocity Group**\n| CLI Name | Type | Range | Default | MSP? | →Internal | Description |\n|----------|------|-------|---------|------|-----------|-------------|\n| `ferocity_downstroke` | UINT8 | [1,100] | 12 | ❌ | →[1.0, 8.0] | Downstroke wave sharpness |\n| `ferocity_upstroke` | UINT8 | [1,100] | 12 | ❌ | →[1.0, 8.0] | Upstroke wave sharpness |\n\n**Table: ONDAS Three-Channel Group**\n| CLI Name | Type | Range | Default | MSP? | Scale Factor | Modulates |\n|----------|------|-------|---------|------|-------------|-----------|\n| `ondas_gain` | INT8 | [-128,127] | 20 | ✅ (UINT8!) | ×0.00005 | P→k₀ phase advance |\n| `ondas_gain2` | INT8 | [-128,127] | 20 | ❌ | ×0.0003 | D→ferocity depth |\n| `ondas_gain3` | INT8 | [-128,127] | 10 | ❌ | ×0.0001 | I→asymmetry bias |\n\n**Table: Aeroelastic Group**\n| CLI Name | Type | Range | Default | MSP? | Description |\n|----------|------|-------|---------|------|-------------|\n| `aeroelastic_glide_coefficient` | UINT8 | [0,100] | 40 | ❌ | Gain modifier in glide |\n| `aeroelastic_flap_coefficient` | UINT8 | [0,100] | 40 | ❌ | Gain modifier in flapping |\n| `ssff_gain` | UINT8 | [0,100] | 0 | ❌ | Stroke-synchronous FF strength |\n\n**MSP Gap Enumeration (6 params CLI-only)**\n\n| Parameter | Proposed MSP Cmd | Size | Notes |\n|-----------|-----------------|------|-------|\n| `ondas_gain2` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG (0x30F0) | 1B INT8 | New message |\n| `ondas_gain3` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 1B INT8 | Same message |\n| `ssff_gain` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 1B UINT8 | Same message |\n| `aeroelastic_glide_coefficient` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 1B UINT8 | Same message |\n| `aeroelastic_flap_coefficient` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 1B UINT8 | Same message |\n| `flap_base_frequency` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 1B UINT8 | Same message |\n| `flap_base_amplitude` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 1B UINT8 | Same message |\n| `ferocity_downstroke` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 1B UINT8 | Same message |\n| `ferocity_upstroke` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 1B UINT8 | Same message |\n| `flap_speed_modificator` | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG | 2B UINT16 | controlRateConfig |\n\n**Bug**: `ondas_gain` exposed as **UINT8** in MSP (line 1424) but **INT8** in CLI — range mismatch [0,255] vs [-128,127].\n\n#### 05_CRITIQUE.md — Weakness Evidence Map\n\n| # | Weakness | Severity | Evidence | Fix Direction |\n|---|----------|----------|----------|---------------|\n| W1 | Dead propeller features | Med | `common_pre.h:308-316` — 8 #undef'd | Purge entirely |\n| W2 | pid.h commented-out externs | Low | `pid.h:205-212` — 6 dead declarations | Remove |\n| W3 | sim_ferocity.rb duplicate code | Low | Lines 427-453 duplicate lines 401-426 | Deduplicate in mode_prize |\n| W4 | MSP exposure gap (6 params) | High | 0 hits for ondas_gain2 in msp.c | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG message |\n| W5 | MSP type mismatch (ondas_gain) | High | UINT8 in MSP, INT8 in CLI | Unify to INT8 |\n| W6 | ONDAS.md outdated | Med | References old single-channel model | Supersede with 02+07 docs |\n| W7 | 99.43% flash, no headroom | High | F7 target at limit | Identify 2% reclaimable |\n| W8 | pid.c owns too much | Med | ODE+PID+ONDAS+SSFF+aeroelastic in 1857 lines | Extract orni_flight.c |\n| W9 | Single-axis (PITCH-only) ONDAS | Med | ROLL uses standard PID only | Multi-axis in medium-term |\n| W10 | Hardcoded k₀=1.0, k₂=10.0 | Low | `pid.c` globals, no CLI | Consider exposure if validated |\n| W11 | Naming: gain/gain2/gain3 | Med | No semantic names | Rename: gain_phase/gain_ferocity/gain_asymmetry |\n| W12 | No failsafe glide profile | High | Failsafe = freeze outputs | Glide-to-land descent |\n| W13 | Anti-gravity stubs | Low | No-op bodies under USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY | Remove callers or repurpose |\n\n#### 06_IMPROVEMENT_VISION.md — Roadmap Map\n\n| Horizon | Item | Difficulty | Impact | Deps |\n|---------|------|-----------|--------|------|\n| **Immediate** | MSP2_ORNI_CONFIG for 6 CLI-only params | ★★ | ★★★★★ | None |\n| **Immediate** | Fix ondas_gain MSP type mismatch | ★ | ★★★ | None |\n| **Immediate** | Remove 8 #undef'd propeller features | ★ | ★★ | Verify no callers |\n| **Immediate** | Remove 6 dead pid.h externs | ★ | ★ | None |\n| **Immediate** | Deduplicate sim_ferocity.rb mode_prize | ★ | ★ | None |\n| **Immediate** | Update ONDAS.md → point to magnum_opus | ★ | ★★★ | 02+07 complete |\n| **Short-term** | Autotune: sim_ferocity.rb → PID/discovery | ★★★ | ★★★★★ | MSP complete |\n| **Short-term** | CLI inter-parameter guardrails | ★★ | ★★★ | None |\n| **Short-term** | Blackbox orni signals (θ,ω,ferocity,mod) | ★★★ | ★★★★ | Flash budget |\n| **Short-term** | Configurator three-channel UI tab | ★★★★ | ★★★★ | MSP complete |\n| **Medium** | Extract orni_flight.c from pid.c | ★★★★ | ★★★★ | None |\n| **Medium** | Multi-axis ONDAS (roll differential ferocity) | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ | orni_flight.c |\n| **Long** | Autonomous perch via glide + baro | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ | Multi-axis |\n| **Long** | Species-specific wing profile presets | ★★★ | ★★★ | Parameter system |\n\n#### 07_SIMULATION.md — Mode Documentation Map\n\n| Mode | Function | Lines | Physics Coverage |\n|------|----------|-------|-----------------|\n| wave | `mode_wave` | 287-300 | Static wave shape over 360°, ferocity effect on tanh profile |\n| compare | `mode_compare` | 302-339 | Fixed vs SSFF side-by-side, CG offset cancellation |\n| flight | `mode_flight` | 341-359 | Full wing ODE + 1st-order airframe (I_YY=0.02, PITCH_DAMP=0.3) + PID (Kp=8.0, Ki=0.5, Kd=2.0) + ONDAS + SSFF |\n| sweep | `mode_sweep` | 361-373 | 11×11 fDown×fUp grid, RMS pitch/rate metrics |\n| derive | `mode_derive` | 375-395 | Velocity amplification: deriv_gain × cosθ × ω at each phase |\n| prize | `mode_prize` | 397-470 | **BUG**: duplicate code block lines 427-453; full theory demonstration with CG offset + gust |\n\n---\n\n### 4. Quality Gates (per document)\n\n| Document | Gate |\n|----------|------|\n| 02_CONTROL_THEORY | Every equation has: derivation, physical interpretation, firmware location, sensitivity data |\n| 03_PARAMETER_SPACE | All 16+ orni params tabled; MSP gaps enumerated; interaction matrix filled |\n| 01_ARCHITECTURE | 3 Mermaid diagrams renderable; full gyro→servo trace; init sequence documented |\n| 07_SIMULATION | All 6 modes documented; sim↔firmware variable mapping table; bug noted |\n| 04_IDENTITY | Identity statement <200 words; 5+ design principles with code evidence |\n| 05_CRITIQUE | All 13 weaknesses have file:line evidence; dead code catalogued |\n| 06_IMPROVEMENT_VISION | Every horizon has 3+ items; all with difficulty×impact stars |\n| 00_INDEX | 3 reading paths; question→document lookup table |\n\n---\n\n### 5. Philosopher's Stone: The Unifying Principle\n\nThe stone that transmutes raw cartography into golden documents is a single organizing principle: **every claim must be grounded in a specific file and line number**. The `<file>` tag system is not decoration — it is the hermetic correspondence that binds abstract theory to living code. Every Mermaid diagram maps to actual C control flow. Every parameter table maps to a PG registration. Every weakness cites evidence. This is how the report transcends documentation and becomes a *verifiable model* of the system.\n\nI now seal the Rubedo and proceed. The philosopher's stone is selected: **evidence-grounded Markdown with Mermaid+LaTeX, zero external dependencies, built in dependency order from mathematics outward.**"}]
