, :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: 427:  puts &quot;????????? Velocity Amplification by Ferocity ?????????&quot;\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.072}, :args=>{:cmd=>"grep -n \"Velocity Amplification by Ferocity\" sim_ferocity.rb"}, :execution_time=>0.072}, {:content=>"All must-do items complete. Let me now inscribe the coagula results in memory and complete the step:"}, {:id=>"call_00_NNefzFpq3tmc9Pot4HgK4546", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.005}, :args=>{:content=>"Coagula phase implemented 6 changes across 4 files:\n\npid.h: Removed 6 commented-out extern declarations (flappingSinusoid, flappingCosinusoid, coFlapping, flappingAmplitude, flappingSquared, flappingDerivative). Only active externs remain: ornithopterFlapping, throttle_.\n\npid.c: (1) Extracted 5 magic numbers to #defines near k0/k2: ONDAS_K0=1.0f, ONDAS_K2=10.0f, ONDAS_PHASE_SCALE=0.00005f, ONDAS_FEROCITY_SCALE=0.0003f, ONDAS_ASYMMETRY_SCALE=0.0001f, FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE=0.1f. Three-channel modulation and ferocity blend zones now use named constants. (2) Wrapped itermAcceleratorGain declaration and init in #ifndef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY. itermAccelerator left unwrapped (used at line 1516 outside guard). (3) Fixed pre-existing bug: antiGravityMode=0 in #else branch removed — variable not declared under USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY.\n\nmsp.c: Fixed ondas_gain MSP encoding — was raw UINT8, now uses signed +128/-128 pattern matching ornithopter_glide_deg. Write: sbufWriteU8(dst, (uint8_t)(val+128)). Read: (int8_t)(sbufReadU8(src)-128).\n\nsim_ferocity.rb: Removed 28-line duplicate \"Velocity Amplification by Ferocity\" block in mode_prize (was at lines 437-464).", :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/pid.h", "src/main/msp/msp.c", "sim_ferocity.rb"], :tags=>["code", "coagula", "cleanup", "magic-numbers", "msp-fix", "build"]}, :execution_time=>0.005}, {:id=>"call_01_ChuNilGm8v5E8lOu8fjc5636", :name=>"task_aegis", :result=>{:aegis_notes=>[{:id=>11, :content=>"Three-channel breathing-pause architecture in pid.c — PID terms modulate wing-trajectory parameters, not servo offset:\n\nChannel 1: P-term → phase advance via k0 scaling. \"Push harder now.\" `flappingPhaseModulation = 1.0 + P * ondas_gain * 0.00005`, clamped [0.5, 2.0]. Applied as `k0 * modulation` in wing ODE. Compresses/stretches current ramp.\n\nChannel 2: D-term → ferocity (wave sharpness). \"Delay next opposite stroke.\" `flappingFerocityModulation = D * ondas_gain2 * 0.0003`, clamped [-0.5, 0.5]...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,pid,architecture,three-channel,breathing-pause", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 13:55:53", :score=>45}, {:id=>16, :content=>"Three-channel breathing-pause modulation in pid.c PID loop (PITCH axis only): P-term→phase advance via k0 scaling: flappingPhaseModulation = 1.0 + P * ondas_gain * 0.00005, clamped [0.5, 2.0]. Applied as k0 * modulation in wing ODE. D-term→ferocity wave sharpness: flappingFerocityModulation = D * ondas_gain2 * 0.0003, clamped [-0.5, 0.5]. Applied as dMod in applyFerocityWaveShaping(). I-term→up/down asymmetry: flappingAsymmetryBias = I * ondas_gain3 * 0.0001, clamped [-3.0, 3.0]. Applied as iBia...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,pid,architecture,three-channel,breathing-pause", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>41}, {:id=>12, :content=>"Ferocity wave-shaping in pid.c: `applyFerocityWaveShaping(sinTheta, dMod, iBias)` computes tanh(F·sinθ)/tanh(F). Now accepts 2 additional params: dMod (D-term ferocity modulation factor, scales both fDown/fUp equally for breathing pause depth) and iBias (I-term asymmetry, adds to fUp, subtracts from fDown). SSFF biases still added before these. Per-stroke ferocity with ±0.1 rad blend zone. Clamped [1.0, 8.0]. Phase ODE: θ̈=k₀·P_mod·T_cmd−k₂·ω where P_mod = flappingPhaseModulation ∈ [0.5, 2.0]. O...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,architecture,three-channel", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 13:56:09", :score=>30}, {:id=>37, :content=>"Coagula phase implemented 6 changes across 4 files:\n\npid.h: Removed 6 commented-out extern declarations (flappingSinusoid, flappingCosinusoid, coFlapping, flappingAmplitude, flappingSquared, flappingDerivative). Only active externs remain: ornithopterFlapping, throttle_.\n\npid.c: (1) Extracted 5 magic numbers to #defines near k0/k2: ONDAS_K0=1.0f, ONDAS_K2=10.0f, ONDAS_PHASE_SCALE=0.00005f, ONDAS_FEROCITY_SCALE=0.0003f, ONDAS_ASYMMETRY_SCALE=0.0001f, FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE=0.1f. Three-channel modula...", :tags=>"code,coagula,cleanup,magic-numbers,msp-fix,build", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/pid.h,src/main/msp/msp.c,sim_ferocity.rb", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:23:29", :score=>29}, {:id=>26, :content=>"sim_ferocity.rb: Ruby simulation harness with 6 modes. Mode wave: static wave shape analysis over 360° cycle. Mode flight: full wing ODE + airframe (1st-order pitch dynamics, I_YY=0.02, PITCH_DAMP=0.3) + PID (Kp=8.0, Ki=0.5, Kd=2.0) + ONDAS gate + ferocity + SSFF. Mode sweep: parameter scan over F_down × F_up grid (11×11) measuring RMS pitch/rate. Mode compare: fixed vs SSFF side-by-side. Mode derive: velocity amplification by ferocity at each phase. Mode prize: full theory demonstration. Wing O...", :tags=>"code,simulation,ferocity,ondas,ssff,ruby", :links=>"sim_ferocity.rb,src/main/flight/pid.c,ONDAS.md", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:09:14", :score=>27}, {:id=>23, :content=>"PID flow in pidController(): (1) Pre-calc gyro D-term with RPM filter + notch + dual lowpass cascade. (2) Init flapping amplitude via getFlappingAmplitude(throttle_*1000+1000). (3) calculateFlappingFromThrottle(): wing ODE step + ferocity wave shaping, populates ornithopterFlapping/shapedFlappingSinusoid. (4) Per-axis loop: setpoint rate → accel limit → level/horizon modes → acro trainer → launch control → yaw spin recovery → error rate. (5) On PITCH: applyStrokeSynchronousFF(errorRate) → three-...", :tags=>"code,pid,flow,architecture,control-loop", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/pid.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:50", :score=>25}, {:id=>8, :content=>"Simulation harness at sim_ferocity.rb with 3 modes: wave (static wave shape at given ferocity), flight (full wing ODE + airframe + PID pitch dynamics), sweep (parameter scan over ferocity combinations). Key findings: F=1.0 (pure sine) gives symmetric thrust with minimal pitch disturbance; balanced ferocity (F_down≈F_up≈5-6) minimizes pitch amplitude; higher ferocity (>7) narrows ONDAS window but increases pitch oscillation slightly. Wing ODE: θ̈=k₀·T_cmd−k₂·ω with θ modulo 2π. Airframe: 1st-orde...", :tags=>"simulation,ferocity,ondas,code", :links=>"sim_ferocity.rb,src/main/flight/pid.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-14 02:03:10", :score=>25}, {:id=>18, :content=>"SSFF (Stroke-Synchronous Feed-Forward) in pid.c: measures pitch errorRate over each half-stroke, biases next stroke's ferocity. applyStrokeSynchronousFF(pitchErrorRate) called on PITCH axis. Detects sinθ zero crossing: when prevSin * sin <= 0 and they differ → half-stroke boundary. Computes mean error = ssffAccumError/ssffAccumCount. If prevSin > 0 (finished downstroke): ssffFerocityUpBias = ssff_gain * 0.001 * meanError. If prevSin < 0 (finished upstroke): ssffFerocityDownBias = -ssff_gain * 0....", :tags=>"code,ssff,feed-forward,ferocity,pid", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,sim_ferocity.rb,ONDAS.md", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>23}], :aegis_orientation=>{:tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "three-channel", "coagula", "cleanup"], :summary=>"Coagula complete: 5 must-do items implemented. pid.h 6 dead externs removed. pid.c 6 magic numbers→#defines, itermAcceleratorGain guarded, antiGravityMode pre-existing bug fixed. msp.c ondas_gain MSP signed encoding fixed. sim_ferocity.rb duplicate velocity block removed. pid.c compiles clean. Pre-existing linker error (mixers) unrelated.", :temperature=>0.8, :working_dir=>nil, :thinking=>nil}, :task_id=>2, :execution_time=>0.014}, :args=>{:summary=>"Coagula complete: 5 must-do items implemented. pid.h 6 dead externs removed. pid.c 6 magic numbers→#defines, itermAcceleratorGain guarded, antiGravityMode pre-existing bug fixed. msp.c ondas_gain MSP signed encoding fixed. sim_ferocity.rb duplicate velocity block removed. pid.c compiles clean. Pre-existing linker error (mixers) unrelated.", :tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "three-channel", "coagula", "cleanup"]}, :execution_time=>0.014}, {:content=>""}]
