ID everywhere\\n        //   gain=1...\",\"path\":\"src/main/flight/pid.c\"},\"execution_time\":0.736},{\"content\":\"\",\"args\":null,\"result\":null},{\"id\":\"call_00_UuVa9fzKdkD2pzZ7xnvI5478\",\"name\":\"aegis\",\"result\":{\"aegis_notes\":[{\"id\":11,\"content\":\"Three-channel breathing-pause architecture in pid.c — PID terms modulate wing-trajectory parameters, not servo offset:\\n\\nChannel 1: P-term → phase advance via k0 scaling. \\\"Push harder now.\\\" `flappingPhaseModulation = 1.0 + P * ondas_gain * 0.00005`, clamped [0.5, 2.0]. Applied as `k0 * modulation` in wing ODE. Compresses/stretches current ramp.\\n\\nChannel 2: D-term → ferocity (wave sharpness). \\\"Delay next opposite stroke.\\\" `flappingFerocityModulation = D * ondas_gain2 * 0.0003`, clamped [-0.5, 0.5]...\",\"tags\":\"code,ferocity,ondas,pid,architecture,three-channel,breathing-pause\",\"links\":\"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29 13:55:53\",\"score\":59},{\"id\":12,\"content\":\"Ferocity wave-shaping in pid.c: `applyFerocityWaveShaping(sinTheta, dMod, iBias)` computes tanh(F·sinθ)/tanh(F). Now accepts 2 additional params: dMod (D-term ferocity modulation factor, scales both fDown/fUp equally for breathing pause depth) and iBias (I-term asymmetry, adds to fUp, subtracts from fDown). SSFF biases still added before these. Per-stroke ferocity with ±0.1 rad blend zone. Clamped [1.0, 8.0]. Phase ODE: θ̈=k₀·P_mod·T_cmd−k₂·ω where P_mod = flappingPhaseModulation ∈ [0.5, 2.0]. O...\",\"tags\":\"code,ferocity,ondas,architecture,three-channel\",\"links\":\"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-29 13:56:09\",\"score\":38},{\"id\":8,\"content\":\"Simulation harness at sim_ferocity.rb with 3 modes: wave (static wave shape at given ferocity), flight (full wing ODE + airframe + PID pitch dynamics), sweep (parameter scan over ferocity combinations). Key findings: F=1.0 (pure sine) gives symmetric thrust with minimal pitch disturbance; balanced ferocity (F_down≈F_up≈5-6) minimizes pitch amplitude; higher ferocity (>7) narrows ONDAS window but increases pitch oscillation slightly. Wing ODE: θ̈=k₀·T_cmd−k₂·ω with θ modulo 2π. Airframe: 1st-orde...\",\"tags\":\"simulation,ferocity,ondas,code\",\"links\":\"sim_ferocity.rb,src/main/flight/pid.c\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-14 02:03:10\",\"score\":25},{\"id\":5,\"content\":\"Gralha Azul (RP2040) ferocity formula in formaDoBaterDasAsas(): shapedWave = tanh(ferocity * sin(θ)) / tanh(ferocity). Ferocity per channel: downstroke (CH7, 1.0-8.0), upstroke (CH8, 1.0-8.0), with linear blend zone ±0.1 rad at zero crossing. Low ferocity → pure sine; high ferocity → near square wave (earlier movement, longer at extreme). Wave always normalized to [-1,+1]. Servo rate limiting in glide: ferocity controls transition speed. Constants: FEROCIDADE_MINIMA_PADRAO=1.0, FEROCIDADE_MAXIMA...\",\"tags\":\"ferocity,code,formula,gralha-azul\",\"links\":\"~~/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/src/GralhaAzul.h~~ (path not found),~~/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/src/GralhaAzul_Padraos.h~~ (path not found)\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-14 01:34:07\",\"score\":11},{\"id\":1,\"content\":\"OrniFlight: open-source flight control for servo-flapping ornithopters, forked from Betaflight 4.0.6. FORKNAME=orniflight. GPL v3 licensed. Key innovation: ONDAS (Oscillating Normalized Dynamic Adaptive Stabilization) for flapping-wing flight dynamics.\\n\\nProject structure: src/main/ with standard Betaflight layout — flight/, fc/, drivers/, sensors/, io/, cli/, msp/, rx/, osd/, telemetry/, pg/, config/. Build via Makefile targeting STM32F3/F4/F7 MCUs.\",\"tags\":\"code,structure,overview\",\"links\":\"README.md,Makefile,src/main/flight/\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-14 01:17:15\",\"score\":4}],\"aegis_orientation\":{\"tags\":[\"ferocity\",\"ondas\",\"pid\",\"architecture\",\"three-channel\",\"breathing-pause\"],\"summary\":\"Three-channel breathing-pause architecture implemented. P-term → k0 phase modulation (ondas_gain=20), D-term → ferocity wave-sharpness (ondas_gain2...\",\"temperature\":1.0,\"working_dir\":null,\"thinking\":null},\"execution_time\":0.007},\"args\":{\"summary\":\"Three-channel breathing-pause architecture implemented. P-term → k0 phase modulation (ondas_gain=20), D-term → ferocity wave-sharpness (ondas_gain2=20), I-term → up/down asymmetry bias (ondas_gain3=10). Old ONDAS authority gate and feed-forward subtraction removed. D-term gyro delta gate removed....\",\"tags\":[\"ferocity\",\"ondas\",\"pid\",\"architecture\",\"three-channel\",\"breathing-pause\"]},\"execution_time\":0.008}]", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 13:56:57"}
entry {:prompt=>"is the new system compatible with config and configurator? the configurator will be handled in another context. please handover me a prompt what the configurator needs to change", :answer=>"<<empty>>", :tool_call_count=>0, :execution_time=>1.458915, :timestamp=>nil, :tool_calls_json=>"[]", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 14:01:06"}
entry {:prompt=>"continue", :answer=>"## Compatibility Analysis\n\n### ✅ Config / CLI — Fully Compatible\n\nThe `servoConfig_t` struct layout is **unchanged**: same three `int8_t` fields at the same offsets, same PG version (0), same CLI entries in `settings.c` (`ondas_gain`, `ondas_gain2`, `ondas_gain3`). Existing config dumps and EEPROM saves load without issue. The only difference is **semantics** — what these fields *mean* — and **defaults**.\n\n| Field | Old Default | New Default | Old Meaning | New Meaning |\n|-------|------------|------------|-------------|-------------|\n| `ondas_gain` | 50 | 20 | ONDAS authority gate gain | **P-term** → phase advance (k₀ scaling) |\n| `ondas_gain2` | 0 (unused) | 20 | (merged into P, dead code) | **D-term** → ferocity modulation (breathing pause depth) |\n| `ondas_gain3` | 0 (unused) | 10 | (unreachable, dead code) | **I-term** → up/down ferocity asymmetry bias |\n\nRange is `-100..100` for all three. Users upgrading firmware will want to reset to defaults or manually retune.\n\n### ⚠️ MSP — Partial Exposure\n\nOnly `ondas_gain` is exposed over MSP, appended to `MSP_PID_ADVANCED` (msg 94/95):\n\n```\nMSP_PID_ADVANCED out (line 1424):  sbufWriteU8(dst, servoConfigMutable()->ondas_gain);\nMSP_SET_PID_ADVANCED in (line 2098): servoConfigMutable()->ondas_gain = sbufReadU8(src);\n```\n\n`ondas_gain2` and `ondas_gain3` have **no MSP path**. The configurator can't read or write them.\n\n`MSP_SERVO_CONFIGURATIONS` (msg 120/212) only carries per-servo params (`min/max/middle/rate/forwardFromChannel/reversedSources`) plus `ornithopter_glide_deg` — it does **not** carry any `ondas_gain*` fields.\n\n---\n\n## Configurator Handover Prompt\n\nUse this in the next context — paste verbatim:\n\n---\n\n> **OrniFlight Configurator — Three-Channel ONDAS Update**\n>\n> The firmware now uses a three-channel breathing-pause architecture for flapping-wing stabilization. PID terms modulate wing trajectory parameters instead of servo offset.\n>\n> **Background**: The three `ondas_gain*` fields in `servoConfig_t` (int8, range -100..100, PG_SERVO_CONFIG) have been repurposed:\n>\n> | MSP Field | New Label | New Tooltip | New Default |\n> |-----------|-----------|-------------|-------------|\n> | `ondas_gain` (existing in MSP_PID_ADVANCED) | **Phase Advance Gain** | \"P-term → flapping phase acceleration. Higher values make the wing respond more aggressively to pitch error by varying k₀ (phase drive strength). 'Push harder now.' \" | 20 |\n> | `ondas_gain2` (needs MSP exposure) | **Breathing Pause Depth** | \"D-term → ferocity modulation depth. Higher values deepen the breathing pause at stroke extremes when error is accelerating, delaying the next opposite stroke. Stabilizes by redistributing rhythm.\" | 20 |\n> | `ondas_gain3` (needs MSP exposure) | **Asymmetry Bias** | \"I-term → upstroke/downstroke ferocity bias. Persistent asymmetry shifts thrust balance between half-cycles. Positive = harder upstrokes (pitch-down bias).\" | 10 |\n>\n> **MSP changes needed:**\n> 1. Add `ondas_gain2` and `ondas_gain3` as `sbufWriteU8`/`sbufReadU8` at the end of `MSP_PID_ADVANCED` (msg 94/95), just after the existing `ondas_gain`. Append both in order (gain2, gain3) for both read and write.\n> 2. Update the `MSP_SERVO_CONFIGURATIONS` out message (msg 120) to include all three gains after `ornithopter_glide_deg`.\n> 3. The `MSP_SET_SERVO_CONFIGURATION` in message (msg 212) should accept the extended format.\n>\n> **UI changes needed:**\n> - Rename \"ONDAS Gain\" → \"Phase Advance Gain\" with the tooltip above\n> - Add two new sliders: \"Breathing Pause Depth\" and \"Asymmetry Bias\"\n> - Default values: 20, 20, 10\n> - Range: -100 to 100 for all three\n> - Consider grouping them under a header \"Wing Trajectory Modulation\" or \"Breathing Pause\"\n>\n> **Firmware reference**: `src/main/flight/pid.c` lines ~90-104 (globals), ~640-710 (`applyFerocityWaveShaping` with dMod/iBias params, `calculateFlappingFromThrottle` with k0 modulation), ~1590-1640 (three-channel computation from pidData). `src/main/flight/servos.h` lines 141-146 (struct fields). `src/main/cli/settings.c` lines 1429-1431 (CLI table). `src/main/flight/servos.c` lines 71-73 (defaults).\n\n---\n\nShall I also add `ondas_gain2` and `ondas_gain3` to the MSP PID_ADVANCED message in `msp.c` now, so the firmware side is complete?", :tool_call_count=>26, :execution_time=>73.752822, :timestamp=>nil, :tool_calls_json=>"[{\"content\":\"\",\"args\":null,\"result\":null},{\"id\":\"call_00_emmJ413XGFVphfWqWqP47171\",\"name\":\"file_overview\",\"result\":{\"notes_count\":3,\"notes_preview\":null,\"file_info\":{\"lines\":174,\"size\":6202,\"last_modified\":\"2026-07-29 15:54:38 +0200\",\"path\":\"src/main/flight/servos.h\"},\"structural_summary\":{\"language\":\"ruby\",\"containers\":0,\"members\":25,\"imports\":0,\"exports\":0,\"total_symbols\":25},\"symbolic_overview\":\"29: con INPUT_STABILIZED_ROLL\\n52: con SERVO_GIMBAL_PITCH\\n53: con SERVO_GIMBAL_ROLL\\n54: con SERVO_FLAPS\\n55: con SERVO_FLAPPERON_1\\n56: con SERVO_FLAPPERON_2\\n57: con SERVO_RUDDER\\n58: con SERVO_ELEVATOR\\n59: con SERVO_THROTTLE\\n61: con SERVO_BICOPTER_LEFT\\n62: con SERVO_BICOPTER_RIGHT\\n64: con SERVO_DUAL...\",\"tag_cloud\":\"code: 6\\nferocity: 4\\nondas: 3\\narchitecture: 2\\nthree-channel: 2\\nornithopter: 1\\nsimulation: 1\\nstructure: 1\\npid: 1\\nbreathing-pause: 1\\nformula: 1\\noverview: 1\\ngralha-azul: 1\\nservo: 1\\nmixer: 1\",\"file_cloud\":\"src/main/flight/servos.c: 3\\nsrc/main/flight/pid.c: 3\\nsrc/main/flight/servos.h: 3\\nsrc/main/cli/settings.c: 3\\nsim_ferocity.rb: 1\\n~~/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_KOSMOI/paraeksperiment/Arduino/libraries/o-grande-codigo-da-gralha-azul/src/GralhaAzul.h~~ (path not found): 1\\nREADME.md: 1\\n~~/Users/d/Desktop/HOI_...\",\"hermetic_overview\":[\"src/main/cli/settings.c>code*3,architecture*2,ferocity*2,ondas*2,three-channel*2\",\"src/main/flight/servos.c>code*3,architecture*2,ferocity*2,ondas*2,three-channel*2\",\"s