entry {:prompt=>"rather than sacrifice the algorithm check what we can omit. like old ondas stuff. betaflight stuff for propellers we never use", :answer=>"---\n\n## Cleansing Complete\n\n### Dead ONDAS Code Removed (pid.c)\n\n| Removed | Reason |\n|---------|--------|\n| `applyPhaseShift()` | Old ONDAS — directly mutated `theta`, competing with new k₀-based P-term modulation |\n| `feedForwardCorrection()` | Never called anywhere |\n| `ondasAuthority` | Computed but never read (was for blackbox only) |\n\n### Anti-Gravity Neutered\n\n16 code blocks in <file>src/main/flight/pid.c</file> and <file>src/main/fc/rc.c</file> wrapped in `#ifndef USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY`. The PG struct field, enum, CLI, MSP, and blackbox references remain for config compatibility — but all runtime computation is compiled to nothing. Functions like `pidOsdAntiGravityActive()` now return `false` unconditionally.\n\n### Propeller Features Disabled (common_pre.h)\n\n8 `#undef` directives appended — all cascade through `common_post.h`:\n\n```\nUSE_DSHOT              → undefs USE_ESC_SENSOR, USE_DSHOT_TELEMETRY, USE_RPM_FILTER\nUSE_DSHOT_TELEMETRY    → undefs USE_RPM_FILTER\nUSE_LAUNCH_CONTROL     → removes launch mode from pid.c, mixer.c, core.c, osd\nUSE_THROTTLE_BOOST     → removes throttle boost HPF from pid.c, mixer.c\nUSE_SMART_FEEDFORWARD  → removes feedforward transition code\nUSE_INTEGRATED_YAW     → removes quad yaw I-term rotation\n```\n\nAll features already had proper `#ifdef` guards throughout the codebase — they simply compile to nothing now.\n\n### Build\n\nFlash: **256,568 / 252KB (99.43%)** — still tight but clean. No warnings.", :tool_call_count=>101, :execution_time=>398.941659, :timestamp=>nil, :tool_calls_json=>"[{\"content\":\"A cleansing ritual. Let me survey what can be excised — old ONDAS remnants first, then propeller-era Betaflight cruft.\",\"args\":null,\"result\":null},{\"id\":\"call_00_B3ZPLVkMR6n0x1LA1D1s5121\",\"name\":\"run_command\",\"result\":{\"ok\":true,\"exit_st