d=>"call_00_VqcXkF24XWmZ9v3GdAJL0102", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: To https://github.com/dantiel/OrniFlight.git\n   83602fc28..f759c7dd7  main -&gt; main\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>2.299}, :args=>{:cmd=>"git push", :timeout=>30}, :execution_time=>2.299}, {:content=>"Pushed: `f759c7dd7`. Now the remaining docs — let me read and fix them."}, {:id=>"call_00_cd1yBEETCrTfJinWBvUq9457", :name=>"read_file", :result=>{:content=>"# 03 — Parameter Space: Complete Reference\n\n## servoConfig_t — All Orni-Specific Fields\n\nDefined in <file>src/main/flight/servos.h</file>, stored in `PG_SERVO_CONFIG`.\n\n| Field | Type | CLI Name | Range | Default | MSP |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|---------|-----|\n| `flap_base_frequency` | `uint8_t` | `flap_base_frequency` | 0–255 | — | ✅ MSP_SET_PID_ADVANCED |\n| `flap_base_amplitude` | `int8_t` | `flap_base_amplitude` | −128–127 | — | ✅ MSP_SET_PID_ADVANCED |\n| `ornithopter_glide_deg` | `int8_t` | `ornithopter_glide_deg` | −128–127 | — | ✅ (own slot) |\n| `ondas_gain` | `int8_t` | `ondas_gain` | −100–100 | 10 | ✅ MSP_FILTER_CONFIG (bias-128) |\n| `ondas_gain2` | `int8_t` | `ondas_gain2` | −100–100 | 10 | ❌ **NO MSP SLOT** |\n| `ondas_gain3` | `int8_t` | `ondas_gain3` | −100–100 | 10 | ❌ **NO MSP SLOT** |\n| `aeroelastic_glide_coefficient` | `int8_t` | `aeroelastic_glide_coefficient` | −128–127 | — | ❌ |\n| `aeroelastic_flap_coefficient` | `int8_t` | `aeroelastic_flap_coefficient` | −128–127 | — | ❌ |\n| `ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke` | `int8_t` | `ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke` | 1–100 | 12 | ❌ |\n| `ornithopter_ferocity_upstroke` | `int8_t` | `ornithopter_ferocity_upstroke` | 1–100 | 12 | ❌ |\n| `ssff_gain` | `int8_t` | `ssff_gain` | 0–100 | 0 | ❌ |\n\n### ⚠️ MSP Exposure Gaps\n\n**Critical**: `ondas_gain2` (D→ferocity) and `ondas_gain3` (I→asymmetry) have NO MSP message slot. The three-channel architecture cannot be fully tuned in-flight via Configurator — only via CLI. This is a first-order limitation for real-time tuning.\n\n**Encoding note**: `ondas_gain` uses bias-128 encoding in MSP_FILTER_CONFIG:\n- Serialize: `(uint8_t)(value + 128)` → maps [−100,100] to [28,228]\n- Deserialize: `(int8_t)(raw − 128)` → correct roundtrip\n\nHowever, the range accepted over MSP is [−128,127] (full int8_t range from uint8_t), bypassing the CLI [−100,100] guard. Downstream clamping in the modulation path mitigates this, but validation should happen at ingestion.\n\n### ferocityParamToFloat Mapping\n\nCLI range [1, 100] maps to ferocity [1.0, 8.0]:\n\n```\nF = 1.0 + (param − 1) × 7.0 / 99.0\n```\n\n| CLI Value | Ferocity F |\n|-----------|------------|\n| 1 | 1.00 (near-sine) |\n| 12 | 1.78 (default) |\n| 25 | 2.70 |\n| 50 | 4.46 |\n| 75 | 6.23 |\n| 100 | 8.00 (maximum) |\n\n**⚠️ Saturation**: Values 81-100 all produce F ∈ [6.66, 8.0] which are clamped identically to 8.0 by `applyFerocityWaveShaping`. The last 20% of the CLI range is indistinguishable — misleading UX.\n\n## PID Profile Parameters (pidProfile_t)\n\nFrom <file>src/main/flight/pid.h</file>, stored in `PG_PID_PROFILE`.\n\nAll standard Betaflight PID parameters are available (P/I/D/F per axis, filter settings, anti-gravity, iterm relax, etc.) with the following OrniFlight modifications:\n\n| Parameter | Status | Notes |\n|-----------|--------|-------|\n| `antiGravityMode` | **Guarded** | Available only when `USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY` is NOT defined (i.e., never in OrniFlight). Default = 0 in OrniFlight branch. |\n| `itermAcceleratorGain` | **Guarded** | Available only when `USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY` is NOT defined. OrniFlight never needs this. |\n| `throttle_boost` | **Undef'd** | `USE_THROTTLE_BOOST` is undef'd by `USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY` cascade |\n| `smart_feedforward` | **Undef'd** | `USE_SMART_FEEDFORWARD` is undef'd by `USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY` cascade |\n| `use_integrated_yaw` | **Undef'd** | `USE_INTEGRATED_YAW_CONTROL` is undef'd |\n| `launchControlMode` | **Undef'd** | `USE_LAUNCH_CONTROL` is undef'd |\n\n## controlRateConfig_t — Rate Profile Extensions\n\nFrom <file>src/main/fc/controlrate_profile.h</file>:\n\n| Field | Type | Range | Purpose |\n|-------|------|-------|---------|\n| `flap_speed_modificator` | `uint16_t` | — | Offsets the throttle→frequency mapping. Center at 1500. Fed into `T_cmd` formula. |\n\n## Three-Channel Gain Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Channel | Feeds Into | Scale Factor | Output Range |\n|-----------|---------|------------|--------------|--------------|\n| `ondas_gain` (−100..100) | P → Phase | `flappingPhaseModulation` | × 0.00005 | [0.5, 2.0] |\n| `ondas_gain2` (−100..100) | D → Ferocity | `flappingFerocityModulation` | × 0.0003 | [−0.5, +0.5] |\n| `ondas_gain3` (−100..100) | I → Asymmetry | `flappingAsymmetryBias` | × 0.0001 | [−3.0, +3.0] |\n\n### Gain Interaction Effects\n\n```\nondas_gain dominant (P → phase):\n  • Higher → wing accelerates faster on error → more aggressive correction\n  • Too high → overshoot, wing racing through strokes\n  • Zero → neutral phase (k₀ = 1.0, no modulation)\n\nondas_gain2 dominant (D → ferocity):\n  • Higher → sharper wave → deeper breathing pause → more damping\n  • Good for gust rejection and fast stabilization\n  • Too high → sluggish response, wing dwell excessive\n\nondas_gain3 dominant (I → asymmetry):\n  • Higher → persistent up/down bias → corrects sustained imbalance\n  • Good for CG offset or manufacturing asymmetry\n  • Too high → trimmed condition overshoot, oscillation at bias frequency\n```\n\n## Simulation Parameters (Hardcoded in sim_ferocity.rb)\n\n| Parameter | Value | Description |\n|-----------|-------|-------------|\n| `Kp` | 8.0 | Pitch P gain |\n| `Ki` | 0.5 | Pitch I gain |\n| `Kd` | 2.0 | Pitch D gain |\n| `I_YY` | 0.02 | Pitch moment of inertia |\n| `PITCH_DAMP` | 0.3 | Aerodynamic pitch damping |\n| `dT` | 0.000125 | Integration timestep (8 kHz) |\n\n## Build-Time Constants (pid.c)\n\n| Constant | Value | Usage |\n|----------|-------|-------|\n| `ONDAS_K0` | 1.0f | Wing ODE drive gain |\n| `ONDAS_K2` | 10.0f | Wing ODE damping |\n| `ONDAS_PHASE_SCALE` | 0.00005f | P→phase scaling |\n| `ONDAS_FEROCITY_SCALE` | 0.0003f | D→ferocity scaling |\n| `ONDAS_ASYMMETRY_SCALE` | 0.0001f | I→asymmetry scaling |\n| `FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE` | 0.1f | Half-stroke blend zone (rad) |\n| `GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD` | 1040 | Throttle value below which glide engages |\n\n## CLI Value Table Entry Format\n\nAll orni-specific parameters in `valueTable[]` (<file>src/main/cli/settings.c</file>):\n\n```c\n// Standard format: {name, type_flags, .config.minmax, PG_ID, offset}\n{\"flap_base_frequency\",   VAR_UINT8  | MASTER_VALUE, .config.minmaxUnsigned = {0,255}, PG_SERVO_CONFIG, offsetof(servoConfig_t, flap_base_frequency)},\n{\"ondas_gain\",            VAR_INT8   | MASTER_VALUE, .config.minmax = {-100,100},      PG_SERVO_CONFIG, offsetof(servoConfig_t, ondas_gain)},\n// etc.\n```\n\n⚠️ `flap_base_frequency` minimum of 0 is a **critical bug** — causes division by zero in the wing ODE. Should be `{1, 255}`.\n", :execution_time=>0.02}, :args=>{:path=>"magnum_opus/03_PARAMETER_SPACE.md"}, :execution_time=>0.021}, {:id=>"call_01_WuyN7efkEtWoA6doNYjY3491", :name=>"read_file", :result=>{:content=>"# 04 — Identity: What OrniFlight IS\n\n## Project Genesis\n\nOrniFlight is a **fork of Betaflight 4.0.6**, created specifically for servo-flapping ornithopters. While Betaflight targets multirotors (quadcopters), OrniFlight replaces motor outputs with oscillating servo-driven wings. The project is licensed under **GPLv3**.\n\n## Core Design Philosophy\n\n### \"PID Modulates Wing Trajectory, Not Servo Offset\"\n\nThis is the fundamental paradigm shift. In a quadcopter, PID directly sets motor speeds — the output is a single scalar per motor. In OrniFlight, PID shapes the wing's **motion path** — the phase, sharpness, and asymmetry of an entire oscillatory trajectory. The wing's interaction with aerodynamics then produces stabilizing forces.\n\n### Three Principles\n\n1. **Trajectory over Torque**: The wing ODE generates a continuous flapping cycle. PID modulates the parameters of this trajectory, not the instantaneous servo position. This means PID corrections are inherently smooth and phase-coherent.\n\n2. **Breathing with the Wing**: ONDAS gates PID authority to the aerodynamic power phase of each stroke. The controller \"breathes\" with the wing — pushing when there's air to push against, relaxing at stroke reversal when the wing has no authority.\n\n3. **Layered Timescales**: Three control layers operate at different timescales synchronized to flapping phase θ:\n   - **Ferocity** (~0 ms): Instantaneous wave shaping at every phase point\n   - **ONDAS** (~1 ms): Intra-stroke PID gating\n   - **SSFF** (~40 ms): Stroke-to-stroke learning\n\n### What OrniFlight Is NOT\n\n- **Not a quadcopter firmware** — it does not control ESCs, BLDC motors, or propeller thrust\n- **Not a generic fixed-wing autopilot** — it's specifically optimized for flapping-wing aerodynamics\n- **Not Betaflight-compatible** — while derived from Betaflight, the `USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY` cascade strips propeller-specific features\n\n## Target Hardware\n\n- **MCUs**: STM32F3, STM32F4, STM32F7\n- **Actuators**: PWM servos (4 ornithopter channels defined: SERVO_ORNITHOPTER_1 through _4)\n- **Sensors**: Gyro (required), Accel (optional, for level mode), Baro/Mag (optional)\n- **RX Protocols**: SBUS, CRSF, IBUS, and all Betaflight-supported serial receivers\n\n## Feature Identity\n\n### OrniFlight Innovations\n\n| Feature | Description | Novelty |\n|---------|-------------|---------|\n| **ONDAS** | Oscillating Normalized Dynamic Adaptive Stabilization — phase-gated PID authority | **Original** — novel control paradigm |\n| **Ferocity Wave-Shaping** | `tanh(F·sinθ)/tanh(F)` — tunable wave sharpness from sine to near-square | **Original** — physically meaningful nonlinearity |\n| **Three-Channel Breathing-Pause** | P→phase advance, D→wave sharpness, I→up/down asymmetry | **Original** — each PID term has distinct physical role |\n| **SSFF** | Stroke-synchronous feed-forward learning flap-frequency error patterns | **Adapted** — repurposed feed-forward concept for oscillatory systems |\n| **Glide Mode** | Wings hold position when throttle below threshold | **Original** — natural for ornithopters |\n| **Aeroelastic PID Scaling** | Velocity-dependent PID gain modulation via shaped derivative | **Original** — compensates for varying aerodynamic authority |\n\n### Inherited from Betaflight (Active)\n\n- PID controller structure (P/I/D/F per axis)\n- Gyro filtering cascade (PT1, BIQUAD, RPM notch)\n- Rate profiles and expo\n- MSP protocol (with OrniFlight extensions)\n- OSD, telemetry (SmartPort, CRSF)\n- CLI configuration system\n- Parameter group (PG) storage system\n\n### Inherited from Betaflight (Stripped by USE_ORNI_MIXER_ONLY)\n\n- DShot motor protocol\n- RPM filters\n- Launch control\n- Throttle boost\n- Smart feedforward\n- Integrated yaw control\n- Brushed ESC autodetect\n\n## Community & Ecosystem\n\n- **Repository**: https://github.com/dantiel/OrniFlight\n- **License**: GPLv3\n- **Build**: `make TARGET=OMNIBUSF7` (or other target)\n- **Configurator**: Betaflight Configurator (with partial OrniFlight parameter support)\n- **Simulation**: `ruby sim_ferocity.rb [mode]` — offline physics validation\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- **`ornithopter_*`**: Parameters specific to ornithopter flight mode\n- **`flap_*`**: Parameters related to flapping mechanics (frequency, amplitude)\n- **`ondas_*`**: Parameters for the ONDAS stabilization system\n- **`ssff_*`**: Stroke-synchronous feed-forward parameters\n- **`aeroelastic_*`**: Aeroelastic compensation coefficients\n- **`SERVO_ORNITHOPTER_*`**: Servo channel enum values for wing servos\n- **`INPUT_STABILIZED_FLAPPING_*`**: Input source enum values for flapping mixer rules\n", :execution_time=>0.007}, :args=>{:path=>"magnum_opus/04_IDENTITY.md"}, :execution_time=>0.007}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_180MKbUs8ALCCtEelgjs0188", :name=>"patch_file", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>1.546}, :args=>{:path=>"magnum_opus/03_PARAMETER_SPACE.md", :diff=>"<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:31\n-------\n### ferocityParamToFloat Mapping\n\nCLI range [1, 100] maps to ferocity [1.0, 8.0]:\n\n```\nF = 1.0 + (param − 1) × 7.0 / 99.0\n```\n\n| CLI Value | Ferocity F |\n|-----------|------------|\n| 1 | 1.00 (near-sine) |\n| 12 | 1.78 (default) |\n| 25 | 2.70 |\n| 50 | 4.46 |\n| 75 | 6.23 |\n| 100 | 8.00 (maximum) |\n\n**⚠️ Saturation**: Values 81-100 all produce F ∈ [6.66, 8.0] which are clamped identically to 8.0 by `applyFerocityWaveShaping`. The last 20% of the CLI range is indistinguishable — misleading UX.\n=======\n### ferocityParamToFloat Mapping\n\nCLI range [1, 100] maps to ferocity [0, 8]:\n\n```\nF = (param − 1) × 8.0 / 99.0   → ferocity ∉ [0, 8]\n```\n\n| CLI Value | Ferocity F |\n|-----------|------------|\n| 1 | 0.00 (pure cosine) |\n| 12 | 0.89 (default) |\n| 25 | 1.94 |\n| 50 | 3.96 |\n| 75 | 5.98 |\n| 100 | 8.00 (pure square wave) |\n\n**F = 0**: Pure cosine wave — symmetric, no dwell. **F = 8**: Pure square wave via `sign(sinθ)` — maximum breathing pause with infinite cos ramp slope. The dwell ratio `d = F/8` ∈ [0,1] determines the portion of each half-stroke spent at ±1 before the cos ramp begins.\n>>>>>>> REPLACE\n\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:65\n-------\n| `FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE` | 0.1f | Half-stroke blend zone (rad) |\n=======\n>>>>>>> REPLACE"}, :execution_time=>1.546}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_VKaqsCyQHGYpCu27wTeu6336", :name=>"patch_file", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.522}, :args=>{:diff=>"<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:40\n-------\n| **Ferocity Wave-Shaping** | `tanh(F·sinθ)/tanh(F)` — tunable wave sharpness from sine to near-square | **Original** — physically meaningful nonlinearity |\n=======\n| **Ferocity Wave-Shaping** | Trapezoidal dwell+cos ramp — tunable wave sharpness from cosine to square wave | **Original** — shared limiar for stable stroke reversal |\n>>>>>>> REPLACE", :path=>"magnum_opus/04_IDENTITY.md"}, :execution_time=>0.523}, {:content=>"Now the stale notes. Let me clean up."}, {:id=>"call_00_DvJNdUyB5GxRv3NxOjVh5610", :name=>"remove_note", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:id=>8}, :execution_time=>0.003}, {:id=>"call_01_EX7XSQ5WmuGwng49Uwdr7530", :name=>"remove_note", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:id=>12}, :execution_time=>0.002}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_6bePieOMJUhdUXfNcGp01154", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.003}, :args=>{:content=>"Trapezoidal wave shaping in pid.c applyFerocityWaveShaping(): dwell ratio d = F/8, F ∈ [0,8]. Each half-stroke: dwell at ±1 for d/2 of half-cycle, then cos ramp from ±1 to ∓1 over remaining (1-d)/2. Shared limiar computed from raw config ferocities (not modulated) for both wings to reverse at same instant. Shaped derivative: 0 in dwell, ∓k·sin(k·(t-dh))·dt/dθ·ω in ramp. ferocityParamToFloat: F = (param-1)*8.0/99.0. F=0 → pure cosine, F=8 → pure square via sign(sinθ). FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE removed.", :tags=>["code", "ferocity", "ondas", "architecture", "trapezoidal", "wave-shaping"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/servos.h", "src/main/cli/settings.c"]}, :execution_time=>0.003}, {:id=>"call_01_Fs4yiFaSiBiZm29uD5tL3282", :name=>"remember", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.002}, :args=>{:content=>"sim_ferocity.rb: Ruby simulation harness with 6 modes. STILL MODELS OLD TANH ALGORITHM — needs update to trapezoidal dwell+cos ramp. Mode wave: static wave shape analysis. Mode flight: full wing ODE + airframe + PID + ONDAS gate + ferocity + SSFF. Mode sweep: parameter scan over F_down × F_up grid. Mode compare: fixed vs SSFF. Mode derive: velocity amplification. Mode prize: full theory demonstration. Wing ODE: θ̈=k₀·T_cmd−k₂·ω, modulo 2π.", :tags=>["simulation", "ferocity", "ondas", "code", "needs-update"], :links=>["sim_ferocity.rb", "src/main/flight/pid.c"]}, :execution_time=>0.003}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_tLpAFsgwmK9d8f2F7DLy4449", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: [main 17210c438] update param space &amp; identity docs for trapezoidal wave shaping; ferocity [0,8] range\n 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)\nTo https://github.com/dantiel/OrniFlight.git\n   f759c7dd7..17210c438  main -&gt; main\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>2.169}, :args=>{:cmd=>"git add magnum_opus/03_PARAMETER_SPACE.md magnum_opus/04_IDENTITY.md && git commit -m \"update param space & identity docs for trapezoidal wave shaping; ferocity [0,8] range\" && git push", :timeout=>30}, :execution_time=>2.17}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_E6Kbw1a5wvzuIs8ZpGxn2464", :name=>"aegis", :result=>{:aegis_notes=>[{:id=>11, :content=>"Three-channel breathing-pause architecture in pid.c — PID terms modulate wing-trajectory parameters, not servo offset:\n\nChannel 1: P-term → phase advance via k0 scaling. \"Push harder now.\" `flappingPhaseModulation = 1.0 + P * ondas_gain * 0.00005`, clamped [0.5, 2.0]. Applied as `k0 * modulation` in wing ODE. Compresses/stretches current ramp.\n\nChannel 2: D-term → ferocity (wave sharpness). \"Delay next opposite stroke.\" `flappingFerocityModulation = D * ondas_gain2 * 0.0003`, clamped [-0.5, 0.5]...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,pid,architecture,three-channel,breathing-pause", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 13:55:53", :score=>59}, {:id=>16, :content=>"Three-channel breathing-pause modulation in pid.c PID loop (PITCH axis only): P-term→phase advance via k0 scaling: flappingPhaseModulation = 1.0 + P * ondas_gain * 0.00005, clamped [0.5, 2.0]. Applied as k0 * modulation in wing ODE. D-term→ferocity wave sharpness: flappingFerocityModulation = D * ondas_gain2 * 0.0003, clamped [-0.5, 0.5]. Applied as dMod in applyFerocityWaveShaping(). I-term→up/down asymmetry: flappingAsymmetryBias = I * ondas_gain3 * 0.0001, clamped [-3.0, 3.0]. Applied as iBia...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,pid,architecture,three-channel,breathing-pause", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>55}, {:id=>40, :content=>"sim_ferocity.rb: Ruby simulation harness with 6 modes. STILL MODELS OLD TANH ALGORITHM — needs update to trapezoidal dwell+cos ramp. Mode wave: static wave shape analysis. Mode flight: full wing ODE + airframe + PID + ONDAS gate + ferocity + SSFF. Mode sweep: parameter scan over F_down × F_up grid. Mode compare: fixed vs SSFF. Mode derive: velocity amplification. Mode prize: full theory demonstration. Wing ODE: θ̈=k₀·T_cmd−k₂·ω, modulo 2π.", :tags=>"simulation,ferocity,ondas,code,needs-update", :links=>"sim_ferocity.rb,src/main/flight/pid.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-30 00:54:45", :score=>29}, {:id=>39, :content=>"Trapezoidal wave shaping in pid.c applyFerocityWaveShaping(): dwell ratio d = F/8, F ∈ [0,8]. Each half-stroke: dwell at ±1 for d/2 of half-cycle, then cos ramp from ±1 to ∓1 over remaining (1-d)/2. Shared limiar computed from raw config ferocities (not modulated) for both wings to reverse at same instant. Shaped derivative: 0 in dwell, ∓k·sin(k·(t-dh))·dt/dθ·ω in ramp. ferocityParamToFloat: F = (param-1)*8.0/99.0. F=0 → pure cosine, F=8 → pure square via sign(sinθ). FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE removed.", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,architecture,trapezoidal,wave-shaping", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-30 00:54:45", :score=>27}, {:id=>26, :content=>"sim_ferocity.rb: Ruby simulation harness with 6 modes. Mode wave: static wave shape analysis over 360° cycle. Mode flight: full wing ODE + airframe (1st-order pitch dynamics, I_YY=0.02, PITCH_DAMP=0.3) + PID (Kp=8.0, Ki=0.5, Kd=2.0) + ONDAS gate + ferocity + SSFF. Mode sweep: parameter scan over F_down × F_up grid (11×11) measuring RMS pitch/rate. Mode compare: fixed vs SSFF side-by-side. Mode derive: velocity amplification by ferocity at each phase. Mode prize: full theory demonstration. Wing O...", :tags=>"code,simulation,ferocity,ondas,ssff,ruby", :links=>"sim_ferocity.rb,src/main/flight/pid.c,ONDAS.md", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:09:14", :score=>27}, {:id=>23, :content=>"PID flow in pidController(): (1) Pre-calc gyro D-term with RPM filter + notch + dual lowpass cascade. (2) Init flapping amplitude via getFlappingAmplitude(throttle_*1000+1000). (3) calculateFlappingFromThrottle(): wing ODE step + ferocity wave shaping, populates ornithopterFlapping/shapedFlappingSinusoid. (4) Per-axis loop: setpoint rate → accel limit → level/horizon modes → acro trainer → launch control → yaw spin recovery → error rate. (5) On PITCH: applyStrokeSynchronousFF(errorRate) → three-...", :tags=>"code,pid,flow,architecture,control-loop", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/pid.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:50", :score=>25}, {:id=>18, :content=>"SSFF (Stroke-Synchronous Feed-Forward) in pid.c: measures pitch errorRate over each half-stroke, biases next stroke's ferocity. applyStrokeSynchronousFF(pitchErrorRate) called on PITCH axis. Detects sinθ zero crossing: when prevSin * sin <= 0 and they differ → half-stroke boundary. Computes mean error = ssffAccumError/ssffAccumCount. If prevSin > 0 (finished downstroke): ssffFerocityUpBias = ssff_gain * 0.001 * meanError. If prevSin < 0 (finished upstroke): ssffFerocityDownBias = -ssff_gain * 0....", :tags=>"code,ssff,feed-forward,ferocity,pid", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,sim_ferocity.rb,ONDAS.md", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>23}, {:id=>15, :content=>"Wing ODE in pid.c: θ̈ = k₀·T_cmd − k₂·ω with θ modulo 2π. k₀=1.0, k₂=10.0 (hardcoded globals). T_cmd computed from RC throttle: tcommand = (rc_throttle - 480.0) * ((1.0/(0.1*flap_base_frequency)) + ((flap_speed_modificator - 1500) * 0.000725)). Phase ODE integrated via explicit Euler: θ += ω·dT, ω += ω̇·dT. Flapping derived as sin(θ) then shaped by ferocity wave. When throttle > GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD(1040): normal flapping. Below: zero flapping (glide). Flapping amplitude: ((throttle - 1040) * 0....", :tags=>"code,wing-ode,pid,physics,architecture", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/pid.h,src/main/pg/pg.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>21}], :aegis_orientation=>{:tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "three-channel", "breathing-pause", "trapezoidal"], :summary=>"Ported trapezoidal wave shaping from GralhaAzul formaDoBaterDasAsas() → pid.c applyFerocityWaveShaping(). Replaced tanh with explicit dwell + cos ramp. ferocity now [0,8] range. Shared limiar for stable stroke reversal. flappingCosinusoid and FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE removed. Docs updated (03_PARAMETER_SPACE, 04_IDENTITY). sim_ferocity.rb still on old tanh — flagged needs-update.", :temperature=>1.0, :working_dir=>nil, :thinking=>nil}, :execution_time=>0.034}, :args=>{:tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "three-channel", "breathing-pause", "trapezoidal"], :summary=>"Ported trapezoidal wave shaping from GralhaAzul formaDoBaterDasAsas() → pid.c applyFerocityWaveShaping(). Replaced tanh with explicit dwell + cos ramp. ferocity now [0,8] range. Shared limiar for stable stroke reversal. flappingCosinusoid and FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE removed. Docs updated (03_PARAMETER_SPACE, 04_IDENTITY). sim_ferocity.rb still on old tanh — flagged needs-update."}, :execution_time=>0.035}]
