 :execution_time=>0.006}, :args=>{:content=>"WARP implemented: roll/yaw ferocity differential for flapping-wing control surfaces. Dual wave shaping (left/right wings) in calculateFlappingFromThrottle(). applyFerocityWaveShaping() now takes output pointers (float *outShaped, float *outDerivative). Left wing: base + warpRoll - warpYaw. Right wing: base - warpRoll + warpYaw. warp_gain and warp_yaw_gain default 0 (off). applyFlappingToServos() in servos.c uses shapedFlappingSinusoidLeft/Right — channels 0,1=left wing, 2,3=right wing. Aerolastic PID uses average of left/right derivative. Externs: flappingAmplitude, shapedFlappingSinusoidLeft/Right in pid.h.", :tags=>["code", "warp", "ferocity", "architecture", "dual-wave", "roll", "yaw"], :links=>["src/main/flight/pid.c", "src/main/flight/servos.c", "src/main/flight/pid.h", "src/main/flight/servos.h"]}, :execution_time=>0.006}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_Wh38XtuYIPEaiCV9xQWm4087", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: A  .aethercodex\nA  .tm-ai/limen.log\nA  .tm-ai/memory.db\nM  ONDAS.md\nA  configurator_handover.md\nA  orniflight_notes1.txt\nM  src/main/cli/settings.c\nM  src/main/flight/pid.c\nM  src/main/flight/pid.h\nM  src/main/flight/servos.c\nM  src/main/flight/servos.h\nM  src/main/msp/msp.c\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.596}, :args=>{:cmd=>"git add -A && git status -s"}, :execution_time=>0.596}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_HFJK0jVD3Tns0P2bM5GX2989", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: A  .tm-ai/memory.db\nM  ONDAS.md\nM  src/main/cli/settings.c\nM  src/main/flight/pid.c\nM  src/main/flight/pid.h\nM  src/main/flight/servos.c\nM  src/main/flight/servos.h\nM  src/main/msp/msp.c\n?? .aethercodex\n?? .tm-ai/limen.log\n?? configurator_handover.md\n?? orniflight_notes1.txt\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.355}, :args=>{:cmd=>"git reset HEAD .aethercodex .tm-ai/limen.log configurator_handover.md orniflight_notes1.txt 2>/dev/null; git add ONDAS.md src/main/cli/settings.c src/main/flight/pid.c src/main/flight/pid.h src/main/flight/servos.c src/main/flight/servos.h src/main/msp/msp.c && git status -s"}, :execution_time=>0.355}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_l2PhSQqwACc68xnznG4V8203", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: [main 95af9ff11] ONDAS: rename channels ??? Cadence/Ferocity/Balance, PD blend, WARP roll/yaw differential\n 8 files changed, 224 insertions(+), 102 deletions(-)\n create mode 100644 .tm-ai/memory.db\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.221}, :args=>{:cmd=>"git commit -m \"ONDAS: rename channels → Cadence/Ferocity/Balance, PD blend, WARP roll/yaw differential\n\n- servos.h: ondas_gain→cadence_gain, ondas_gain2→ferocity_d_gain,\n  ondas_gain3→balance_gain. Added: ferocity_p_gain, warp_gain, warp_yaw_gain.\n- pid.c: Defines renamed (CADENCE_SCALE, FEROCITY_D_SCALE, FEROCITY_P_SCALE,\n  BALANCE_SCALE, WARP_SCALE). Ferocity now PD blend (P+ferocity_p_gain +\n  D+ferocity_d_gain). Dual wave shaping: applyFerocityWaveShaping() takes\n  output pointers, called twice for left/right wings with warp differential.\n  Aerolastic PID uses average derivative.\n- servos.c: applyFlappingToServos() uses shapedFlappingSinusoidLeft/Right.\n  Channels 0,1=left wing, 2,3=right wing.\n- settings.c: CLI params renamed + ferocity_p_gain, warp_gain, warp_yaw_gain.\n- msp.c: cadence_gain replaces ondas_gain in MSP_FILTER_CONFIG.\n- pid.h: externs for flappingAmplitude, shapedFlappingSinusoidLeft/Right.\n- ONDAS.md: Full rewrite for new architecture.\n\nBuild: 99.00% flash (BETAFLIGHTF3).\"", :timeout=>15}, :execution_time=>0.221}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_ET_mq0RC1pR5ukVQr2KRVNE5742", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: To https://github.com/dantiel/OrniFlight.git\n   fd0c13358..95af9ff11  main -&gt; main\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>2.506}, :args=>{:cmd=>"git push 2>&1", :timeout=>30}, :execution_time=>2.506}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_lV6Zg0qp0K5xCBqyFnZW3499", :name=>"aegis", :result=>{:aegis_notes=>[{:id=>42, :content=>"ONDAS architecture renamed in pid.c/servos.h/settings.c/msp.c. Three primaries: CADENCE (P→k0 phase advance, cadence_gain), FEROCITY (PD blend→dwell ratio, ferocity_p_gain + ferocity_d_gain), BALANCE (I→up/down bias, balance_gain). Defines: CADENCE_K0=1.0, CADENCE_K2=10.0, CADENCE_SCALE=0.00005, FEROCITY_P_SCALE=0.00015, FEROCITY_D_SCALE=0.0003, BALANCE_SCALE=0.0001, WARP_SCALE=0.0002. FEROCITY_RANGE=8.0.", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,pid,architecture,cadence,balance,warp", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/cli/settings.c,src/main/msp/msp.c,src/main/flight/pid.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-30 03:08:52", :score=>60}, {:id=>43, :content=>"WARP implemented: roll/yaw ferocity differential for flapping-wing control surfaces. Dual wave shaping (left/right wings) in calculateFlappingFromThrottle(). applyFerocityWaveShaping() now takes output pointers (float *outShaped, float *outDerivative). Left wing: base + warpRoll - warpYaw. Right wing: base - warpRoll + warpYaw. warp_gain and warp_yaw_gain default 0 (off). applyFlappingToServos() in servos.c uses shapedFlappingSinusoidLeft/Right — channels 0,1=left wing, 2,3=right wing. Aerolasti...", :tags=>"code,warp,ferocity,architecture,dual-wave,roll,yaw", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.c,src/main/flight/pid.h,src/main/flight/servos.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-30 03:08:59", :score=>38}, {:id=>41, :content=>"sim_ferocity.rb: Ruby simulation harness with 6 modes. Uses trapezoidal wave shaping (ported from GralhaAzul / OrniFlight): dwell at ±1 for d/2, cos ramp between. f∈[0,8], d=f/8. param_to_f maps [1,100]→[0,8] matching firmware. Mode wave: static shape analysis. Mode flight: wing ODE + airframe + PID + ONDAS gate + ferocity + SSFF. Mode sweep/compare/derive/prize as before. dshaped_dtheta replaces old tanh deriv_gain.", :tags=>"simulation,ferocity,ondas,code,trapezoidal", :links=>"sim_ferocity.rb,src/main/flight/pid.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-30 01:00:40", :score=>29}, {:id=>17, :content=>"Ferocity wave-shaping in pid.c: applyFerocityWaveShaping(sinTheta, dMod, iBias) computes per-stroke ferocity. fDown = ferocityParamToFloat(ornithopter_ferocity_downstroke) + ssffFerocityDownBias - iBias; fUp similarly with +iBias. dMod (D-term factor 1.0+dMod) scales both equally. ferocityParamToFloat: 1.0 + (param-1)*7.0/99.0 → maps [1,100]→[1.0,8.0]. Ferocity per-stroke with ±0.1 rad blend zone (sinθ crossover). shapedWave = tanh(F·sinθ)/tanh(F), clamped [-1,1]. Also computes shapedDerivative ...", :tags=>"code,ferocity,wave-shaping,physics", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>29}, {:id=>23, :content=>"PID flow in pidController(): (1) Pre-calc gyro D-term with RPM filter + notch + dual lowpass cascade. (2) Init flapping amplitude via getFlappingAmplitude(throttle_*1000+1000). (3) calculateFlappingFromThrottle(): wing ODE step + ferocity wave shaping, populates ornithopterFlapping/shapedFlappingSinusoid. (4) Per-axis loop: setpoint rate → accel limit → level/horizon modes → acro trainer → launch control → yaw spin recovery → error rate. (5) On PITCH: applyStrokeSynchronousFF(errorRate) → three-...", :tags=>"code,pid,flow,architecture,control-loop", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/pid.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:50", :score=>29}, {:id=>39, :content=>"Trapezoidal wave shaping in pid.c applyFerocityWaveShaping(): dwell ratio d = F/8, F ∈ [0,8]. Each half-stroke: dwell at ±1 for d/2 of half-cycle, then cos ramp from ±1 to ∓1 over remaining (1-d)/2. Shared limiar computed from raw config ferocities (not modulated) for both wings to reverse at same instant. Shaped derivative: 0 in dwell, ∓k·sin(k·(t-dh))·dt/dθ·ω in ramp. ferocityParamToFloat: F = (param-1)*8.0/99.0. F=0 → pure cosine, F=8 → pure square via sign(sinθ). FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE removed.", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,architecture,trapezoidal,wave-shaping", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-30 00:54:45", :score=>27}, {:id=>15, :content=>"Wing ODE in pid.c: θ̈ = k₀·T_cmd − k₂·ω with θ modulo 2π. k₀=1.0, k₂=10.0 (hardcoded globals). T_cmd computed from RC throttle: tcommand = (rc_throttle - 480.0) * ((1.0/(0.1*flap_base_frequency)) + ((flap_speed_modificator - 1500) * 0.000725)). Phase ODE integrated via explicit Euler: θ += ω·dT, ω += ω̇·dT. Flapping derived as sin(θ) then shaped by ferocity wave. When throttle > GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD(1040): normal flapping. Below: zero flapping (glide). Flapping amplitude: ((throttle - 1040) * 0....", :tags=>"code,wing-ode,pid,physics,architecture", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/pid.h,src/main/pg/pg.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>25}, {:id=>18, :content=>"SSFF (Stroke-Synchronous Feed-Forward) in pid.c: measures pitch errorRate over each half-stroke, biases next stroke's ferocity. applyStrokeSynchronousFF(pitchErrorRate) called on PITCH axis. Detects sinθ zero crossing: when prevSin * sin <= 0 and they differ → half-stroke boundary. Computes mean error = ssffAccumError/ssffAccumCount. If prevSin > 0 (finished downstroke): ssffFerocityUpBias = ssff_gain * 0.001 * meanError. If prevSin < 0 (finished upstroke): ssffFerocityDownBias = -ssff_gain * 0....", :tags=>"code,ssff,feed-forward,ferocity,pid", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,sim_ferocity.rb,ONDAS.md", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>23}], :aegis_orientation=>{:tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "cadence", "balance", "warp", "pd-blend", "dual-wave"], :summary=>"Implemented: (1) Rename ondas_gain→cadence_gain, ondas_gain2→ferocity_d_gain, ondas_gain3→balance_gain. Added ferocity_p_gain for PD-blend on ferocity. (2) WARP: dual wave shaping (left/right wings) with roll/yaw ferocity differential via warp_gain and warp_yaw_gain. applyFerocityWaveShaping() now takes output pointers. Build at 99.00% flash. Next: Anchor (variable k₂ damping), then Resonance, Prescience, Espelho, Saudade.", :temperature=>1.5, :working_dir=>nil, :thinking=>"max"}, :execution_time=>0.026}, :args=>{:summary=>"Implemented: (1) Rename ondas_gain→cadence_gain, ondas_gain2→ferocity_d_gain, ondas_gain3→balance_gain. Added ferocity_p_gain for PD-blend on ferocity. (2) WARP: dual wave shaping (left/right wings) with roll/yaw ferocity differential via warp_gain and warp_yaw_gain. applyFerocityWaveShaping() now takes output pointers. Build at 99.00% flash. Next: Anchor (variable k₂ damping), then Resonance, Prescience, Espelho, Saudade.", :tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "cadence", "balance", "warp", "pd-blend", "dual-wave"]}, :execution_time=>0.027}, {:content=>"Now let me tackle the next frontier: **Anchor** — variable k₂ damping. Currently hardcoded at 10.0. Let me make it tunable."}, {:id=>"call_00_plFZ75Dawiga648EBB7g8849", :name=>"read_file", :result=>{:content=>"\nfloat tcommand = 0;\nfloat omegadot = 0.0;\nfloat thetadot = 0.0;\nfloat omega = 0.0;\nfloat theta = 0.0;\n#define CADENCE_K0               1.0f     // Wing ODE spring constant: scales torque→angular acceleration\n#define CADENCE_K2              10.0f     // Wing ODE damping constant: scales velocity→deceleration\n#define CADENCE_SCALE            0.00005f  // P-term→k0 modulation: PID-P × gain × scale → phase advance\n#define FEROCITY_D_SCALE         0.0003f   // D-term→ferocity modulation: PID-D × gain × scale → wave sharpness\n#define FEROCITY_P_SCALE         0.00015f  // P-term→ferocity modulation: PID-P × gain × scale → wave sharpness\n#define BALANCE_SCALE            0.0001f   // I-term→asymmetry: PID-I × gain × scale → up/down bias\n#define WARP_SCALE               0.0002f   // Roll/Yaw P→ferocity differential: PID-P × gain → L/R or fore/aft\n#define FEROCITY_RANGE           8.0f      // Max ferocity for trapezoidal model (f=0→pure cosine, f=8→square)\n\nfloat k0 = CADENCE_K0;\nfloat k2 = CADENCE_K2;\n", :range=>[597, 613], :execution_time=>0.013}, :args=>{:path=>"src/main/flight/pid.c", :range=>[598, 613]}, :execution_time=>0.013}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_ET_pG3E4ajBkCs3W3RqdFvn4645", :name=>"patch_file", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.072}, :args=>{:diff=>"<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:605\n-------\n#define CADENCE_K2              10.0f     // Wing ODE damping constant: scales velocity→deceleration\n#define CADENCE_SCALE            0.00005f  // P-term→k0 modulation: PID-P × gain × scale → phase advance\n=======\n#define ANCHOR_BASE_K2           10.0f     // Wing ODE base damping: scales velocity→deceleration\n#define ANCHOR_SCALE             0.1f      // anchor_gain→k2: k2 = BASE + gain × scale\n#define CADENCE_SCALE            0.00005f  // P-term→k0 modulation: PID-P × gain × scale → phase advance\n>>>>>>> REPLACE\n\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:613\n-------\nfloat k0 = CADENCE_K0;\nfloat k2 = CADENCE_K2;\n=======\nfloat k0 = CADENCE_K0;\nfloat k2 = ANCHOR_BASE_K2;\n>>>>>>> REPLACE\n", :path=>"src/main/flight/pid.c"}, :execution_time=>0.072}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_mwSPQ74ptqeUnEcWoaHD5859", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: 100://   CADENCE:  P-term ??? phase advance (k0 scaling): &quot;push harder now&quot;\n606:#define ANCHOR_SCALE             0.1f      // anchor_gain???k2: k2 = BASE + gain ?? scale\n607:#define CADENCE_SCALE            0.00005f  // P-term???k0 modulation: PID-P ?? gain ?? scale ??? phase advance\n614:float k0 = CADENCE_K0;\n615:float k2 = ANCHOR_BASE_K2;\n750:    // P-term phase modulation (CADENCE): scales k0 drive term\n753:    float modulatedK0 = k0 * flappingPhaseModulation;\n754:    omegadot = modulatedK0 * tcommand - k2 * omega;\n1659:            //   CADENCE (P???k0): phase advance ??? &quot;push harder now&quot;\n1673:            // --- CADENCE: P ??? phase adv