 sign(sinθ). FEROCITY_BLEND_ZONE removed.", :tags=>"code,ferocity,ondas,architecture,trapezoidal,wave-shaping", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/servos.h,src/main/cli/settings.c", :created_at=>"2026-07-30 00:54:45", :score=>27}, {:id=>15, :content=>"Wing ODE in pid.c: θ̈ = k₀·T_cmd − k₂·ω with θ modulo 2π. k₀=1.0, k₂=10.0 (hardcoded globals). T_cmd computed from RC throttle: tcommand = (rc_throttle - 480.0) * ((1.0/(0.1*flap_base_frequency)) + ((flap_speed_modificator - 1500) * 0.000725)). Phase ODE integrated via explicit Euler: θ += ω·dT, ω += ω̇·dT. Flapping derived as sin(θ) then shaped by ferocity wave. When throttle > GLIDE_MODE_THRESHOLD(1040): normal flapping. Below: zero flapping (glide). Flapping amplitude: ((throttle - 1040) * 0....", :tags=>"code,wing-ode,pid,physics,architecture", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,src/main/flight/pid.h,src/main/pg/pg.h", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>25}, {:id=>18, :content=>"SSFF (Stroke-Synchronous Feed-Forward) in pid.c: measures pitch errorRate over each half-stroke, biases next stroke's ferocity. applyStrokeSynchronousFF(pitchErrorRate) called on PITCH axis. Detects sinθ zero crossing: when prevSin * sin <= 0 and they differ → half-stroke boundary. Computes mean error = ssffAccumError/ssffAccumCount. If prevSin > 0 (finished downstroke): ssffFerocityUpBias = ssff_gain * 0.001 * meanError. If prevSin < 0 (finished upstroke): ssffFerocityDownBias = -ssff_gain * 0....", :tags=>"code,ssff,feed-forward,ferocity,pid", :links=>"src/main/flight/pid.c,sim_ferocity.rb,ONDAS.md", :created_at=>"2026-07-29 19:08:27", :score=>23}], :aegis_orientation=>{:tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "cadence", "balance", "warp", "pd-blend", "dual-wave"], :summary=>"Implemented: (1) Rename ondas_gain→cadence_gain, ondas_gain2→ferocity_d_gain, ondas_gain3→balance_gain. Added ferocity_p_gain for PD-blend on ferocity. (2) WARP: dual wave shaping (left/right wings) with roll/yaw ferocity differential via warp_gain and warp_yaw_gain. applyFerocityWaveShaping() now takes output pointers. Build at 99.00% flash. Next: Anchor (variable k₂ damping), then Resonance, Prescience, Espelho, Saudade.", :temperature=>1.5, :working_dir=>nil, :thinking=>"max"}, :execution_time=>0.026}, :args=>{:summary=>"Implemented: (1) Rename ondas_gain→cadence_gain, ondas_gain2→ferocity_d_gain, ondas_gain3→balance_gain. Added ferocity_p_gain for PD-blend on ferocity. (2) WARP: dual wave shaping (left/right wings) with roll/yaw ferocity differential via warp_gain and warp_yaw_gain. applyFerocityWaveShaping() now takes output pointers. Build at 99.00% flash. Next: Anchor (variable k₂ damping), then Resonance, Prescience, Espelho, Saudade.", :tags=>["ferocity", "ondas", "pid", "architecture", "cadence", "balance", "warp", "pd-blend", "dual-wave"]}, :execution_time=>0.027}, {:content=>"Now let me tackle the next frontier: **Anchor** — variable k₂ damping. Currently hardcoded at 10.0. Let me make it tunable."}, {:id=>"call_00_plFZ75Dawiga648EBB7g8849", :name=>"read_file", :result=>{:content=>"\nfloat tcommand = 0;\nfloat omegadot = 0.0;\nfloat thetadot = 0.0;\nfloat omega = 0.0;\nfloat theta = 0.0;\n#define CADENCE_K0               1.0f     // Wing ODE spring constant: scales torque→angular acceleration\n#define CADENCE_K2              10.0f     // Wing ODE damping constant: scales velocity→deceleration\n#define CADENCE_SCALE            0.00005f  // P-term→k0 modulation: PID-P × gain × scale → phase advance\n#define FEROCITY_D_SCALE         0.0003f   // D-term→ferocity modulation: PID-D × gain × scale → wave sharpness\n#define FEROCITY_P_SCALE         0.00015f  // P-term→ferocity modulation: PID-P × gain × scale → wave sharpness\n#define BALANCE_SCALE            0.0001f   // I-term→asymmetry: PID-I × gain × scale → up/down bias\n#define WARP_SCALE               0.0002f   // Roll/Yaw P→ferocity differential: PID-P × gain → L/R or fore/aft\n#define FEROCITY_RANGE           8.0f      // Max ferocity for trapezoidal model (f=0→pure cosine, f=8→square)\n\nfloat k0 = CADENCE_K0;\nfloat k2 = CADENCE_K2;\n", :range=>[597, 613], :execution_time=>0.013}, :args=>{:path=>"src/main/flight/pid.c", :range=>[598, 613]}, :execution_time=>0.013}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_ET_pG3E4ajBkCs3W3RqdFvn4645", :name=>"patch_file", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.072}, :args=>{:diff=>"<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:605\n-------\n#define CADENCE_K2              10.0f     // Wing ODE damping constant: scales velocity→deceleration\n#define CADENCE_SCALE            0.00005f  // P-term→k0 modulation: PID-P × gain × scale → phase advance\n=======\n#define ANCHOR_BASE_K2           10.0f     // Wing ODE base damping: scales velocity→deceleration\n#define ANCHOR_SCALE             0.1f      // anchor_gain→k2: k2 = BASE + gain × scale\n#define CADENCE_SCALE            0.00005f  // P-term→k0 modulation: PID-P × gain × scale → phase advance\n>>>>>>> REPLACE\n\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:613\n-------\nfloat k0 = CADENCE_K0;\nfloat k2 = CADENCE_K2;\n=======\nfloat k0 = CADENCE_K0;\nfloat k2 = ANCHOR_BASE_K2;\n>>>>>>> REPLACE\n", :path=>"src/main/flight/pid.c"}, :execution_time=>0.072}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_mwSPQ74ptqeUnEcWoaHD5859", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: 100://   CADENCE:  P-term ??? phase advance (k0 scaling): &quot;push harder now&quot;\n606:#define ANCHOR_SCALE             0.1f      // anchor_gain???k2: k2 = BASE + gain ?? scale\n607:#define CADENCE_SCALE            0.00005f  // P-term???k0 modulation: PID-P ?? gain ?? scale ??? phase advance\n614:float k0 = CADENCE_K0;\n615:float k2 = ANCHOR_BASE_K2;\n750:    // P-term phase modulation (CADENCE): scales k0 drive term\n753:    float modulatedK0 = k0 * flappingPhaseModulation;\n754:    omegadot = modulatedK0 * tcommand - k2 * omega;\n1659:            //   CADENCE (P???k0): phase advance ??? &quot;push harder now&quot;\n1673:            // --- CADENCE: P ??? phase advance (k0 scaling) ---\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.105}, :args=>{:cmd=>"grep -n \"k2\\|k0\" src/main/flight/pid.c | head -15"}, :execution_time=>0.105}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_Gvu4UW44iBspI6bYYybd5150", :name=>"run_command", :result=>{:ok=>true, :exit_status=>0, :result=>"Command output: 99:// consumed by calculateFlappingFromThrottle on the next iteration (one-frame lag).\n290:void pidStabilisationState(pidStabilisationState_e pidControllerState)\n292:    pidStabilisationEnabled = (pidControllerState == PID_STABILISATION_ON) ? true : false;\n744:void calculateFlappingFromThrottle(float rc_throttle) {\n1503:void FAST_CODE pidController(const pidProfile_t *pidProfile, timeUs_t currentTimeUs)\n1591:    calculateFlappingFromThrottle(throttle_ * 1000 + 1000);\n1671:            // Values stored for next calculateFlappingFromThrottle call.\n\n(exit 0)", :execution_time=>0.097}, :args=>{:cmd=>"grep -n \"calculateFlappingFromThrottle\\|pidController\" src/main/flight/pid.c | head -10"}, :execution_time=>0.098}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_twC54aBe7NRlvntwujlT7353", :name=>"read_file", :result=>{:content=>"#ifdef USE_RPM_FILTER\n    rpmFilterUpdate();\n#endif\n    \n    // init flapping\n    flappingAmplitude = getFlappingAmplitude(throttle_ * 1000 + 1000);\n    calculateFlappingFromThrottle(throttle_ * 1000 + 1000);\n    \n    // ----------PID controller----------\n    for (int axis = FD_ROLL; axis <= FD_YAW; ++axis) {\n        float currentPidSetpoint = getSetpointRate(axis);\n        if (maxVelocity[axis]) {\n            currentPidSetpoint = accelerationLimit(axis, currentPidSetpoint);\n        }\n        // Yaw control is GYRO based, direct sticks control is applied to rate PID\n", :range=>[1584, 1598], :execution_time=>0.022}, :args=>{:path=>"src/main/flight/pid.c", :range=>[1585, 1598]}, :execution_time=>0.023}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_P19hb44IWGVGBpcyLeE23131", :name=>"patch_file", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.062}, :args=>{:diff=>"<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:1589\n-------\n    // init flapping\n    flappingAmplitude = getFlappingAmplitude(throttle_ * 1000 + 1000);\n    calculateFlappingFromThrottle(throttle_ * 1000 + 1000);\n=======\n    // init flapping\n    flappingAmplitude = getFlappingAmplitude(throttle_ * 1000 + 1000);\n\n    // Anchor: variable k₂ damping — controls frequency lock strength.\n    // Higher = wing snaps to commanded frequency faster (agile, energy-hungry).\n    // Lower = wing resonates freely (efficient cruise, sluggish transients).\n    k2 = ANCHOR_BASE_K2 + (float)servoConfig()->anchor_gain * ANCHOR_SCALE;\n\n    calculateFlappingFromThrottle(throttle_ * 1000 + 1000);\n>>>>>>> REPLACE\n", :path=>"src/main/flight/pid.c"}, :execution_time=>0.063}, {:content=>""}, {:id=>"call_00_RRpBwk7C3pldJw7D2hrg3450", :name=>"patch_file", :result=>{:ok=>true, :execution_time=>0.052}, :args=>{:diff=>"<<<<<<< SEARCH\n:start_line:144\n-------\n    int8_t cadence_gain;                     // P-term → phase advance (k0 scaling): \"push harder now\"\n    int8_t ferocity_d_gain;                  // D-term → ferocity (wave sharpness): \"dampen the motion\"\n    int8_t ferocity_p_gain;                  // P-term → ferocity (wave sharpness): \"push proportionally\"\n    int8_t balance_gain;                     // I-term → thrust symmetry (up/down bias): \"trim the list\"\n    int8_t warp_gain;                        // Roll P-term → L/R ferocity differential: \"bank the wings\"\n    int8_t warp_yaw_gain;                    // Yaw P-term → fore/aft ferocity differential: \"turn the head\"\n=======\n    int8_t cadence_gain;                     // P-term → phase advance (k0 scaling): \"push harder now\"\n    int8_t ferocity_d_gain;                  // D-term → ferocity (wave sharpness): \"dampen the motion\"\n    int8_t ferocity_p_gain;                  // P-term → ferocity (wave sharpness): \"push proportionally\"\n    int8_t balance_gain;                     // I-term → thrust symmetry (up/down bi